(window.AFYA_TX=window.AFYA_TX||{})["pc"]={"pc_oral_tpfl":[["Fluoride toothpaste is the single most effective everyday protection against tooth decay, which the WHO lists among the most common diseases in the world. Choose a paste with 1,000–1,500 ppm fluoride for adults and children over six; children aged 3–6 need only a pea-sized amount and should spit out, not rinse, so the fluoride stays on the teeth. A household of four brushing twice daily uses roughly one 130–140 g tube every two to three weeks, so larger tubes are the better buy. Check that the pack shows a fluoride level and a TMDA or KEBS registration mark, and avoid unlabelled imports and charcoal pastes that make whitening claims without fluoride. Afya stocks a value, a mid and a premium paste so every family can protect its teeth at a price it can repeat every month.","Dawa ya meno yenye floraidi ndiyo kinga bora zaidi ya kila siku dhidi ya kuoza kwa meno, ugonjwa ambao Shirika la Afya Duniani unauweka miongoni mwa magonjwa yanayowapata watu wengi zaidi duniani. Chagua dawa yenye floraidi ya ppm 1,000–1,500 kwa watu wazima na watoto walio zaidi ya miaka sita; watoto wa miaka 3–6 wanahitaji kiasi cha punje ya njegere tu, na watemee bila kusukutua ili floraidi ibaki kwenye meno. Familia ya watu wanne wanaopiga mswaki mara mbili kwa siku hutumia takriban tyubu moja ya gramu 130–140 kila wiki mbili hadi tatu, kwa hiyo tyubu kubwa ni nafuu zaidi. Hakikisha pakiti inaonyesha kiwango cha floraidi na alama ya usajili ya TMDA au KEBS, na epuka bidhaa zisizo na lebo au dawa za mkaa zinazodai kung’arisha meno bila floraidi. Afya Basics ina dawa ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi ya juu ili kila familia ilinde meno yake kwa bei inayoweza kumudu kila mwezi."],["Bought by every household every month: the anchor of the oral-care aisle and the Afya Box","Hununuliwa na kila kaya kila mwezi: nguzo ya rafu ya utunzaji wa kinywa na ya Afya Box"]],"pc_oral_tpsen":[["Sensitivity happens when gums recede or enamel wears and the tiny tubules in the dentine are exposed, so cold, heat or sugar reaches the nerve. Sensitive pastes contain potassium nitrate, which calms the nerve, or stannous fluoride and similar agents, which seal the tubules; they work best when used twice a day for at least two weeks and when the paste is left on the teeth rather than rinsed off. One 75 ml tube lasts one adult about five to six weeks. Brush gently with a soft brush, because hard scrubbing makes sensitivity worse, and see a dentist if pain is in one tooth, lasts more than a few seconds or comes with swelling, as that may be decay or infection. Afya stocks proven sensitive formulas because customers who find relief stay loyal to the product month after month.","Meno huanza kuuma (sensitivity) pale fizi zinaposhuka au enameli inapochakaa na vijinjia vidogo vya dentini vikabaki wazi, hivyo baridi, joto au sukari hufika kwenye neva. Dawa za meno kwa meno yanayouma zina potasiamu naitreti inayotuliza neva, au stanasi floraidi na viambato vingine vinavyoziba vijinjia hivyo; hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi zikitumiwa mara mbili kwa siku kwa angalau wiki mbili, na dawa ikiachwa kwenye meno bila kusukutua mara moja. Tyubu moja ya mililita 75 humtosha mtu mzima mmoja kwa takriban wiki tano hadi sita. Piga mswaki kwa upole ukitumia mswaki laini, kwa sababu kusugua kwa nguvu huzidisha tatizo, na muone daktari wa meno kama maumivu yako kwenye jino moja tu, yanadumu zaidi ya sekunde chache au yanaambatana na uvimbe, kwani huenda ni kuoza au maambukizi. Afya Basics ina dawa zilizothibitishwa kwa sababu wateja wanaopata nafuu huendelea kununua bidhaa hiyo mwezi baada ya mwezi."],["High repeat purchase and a higher price point than everyday paste","Hununuliwa tena na tena na ina bei ya juu kuliko dawa ya kawaida"]],"pc_oral_tpgum":[["Gums that bleed when brushing are an early sign of gingivitis, caused by plaque left along the gum line; it is reversible with careful twice-daily brushing, flossing and a gum-care paste. Gum-care pastes such as those with stannous fluoride or sodium bicarbonate reduce plaque and bleeding within a few weeks, while stain-removing pastes use gentle polishing agents to lift tea, coffee and tobacco stains without bleaching. Use only one of these at a time as your main fluoride paste, and expect one 75 g tube to last an adult about five weeks. Bleeding that continues after two weeks of good brushing, loose teeth or bad breath that does not go away need a dentist, and whitening pastes cannot change the natural colour of teeth. Afya offers these as an easy step up from basic paste, with clear advice so customers buy the right one.","Fizi zinazotoa damu wakati wa kupiga mswaki ni dalili ya mwanzo ya ugonjwa wa fizi (gingivitis) unaosababishwa na utando wa uchafu (plaque) unaobaki kando ya fizi; hali hii inaweza kupona kwa kupiga mswaki kwa makini mara mbili kwa siku, kutumia uzi wa meno na dawa ya kutunza fizi. Dawa za kutunza fizi kama zile zenye stanasi floraidi au sodiamu bikaboneti hupunguza plaque na damu ndani ya wiki chache, na dawa za kuondoa madoa hutumia visugua laini kuondoa madoa ya chai, kahawa na tumbaku bila kemikali za kung’arisha. Tumia moja tu kati ya hizi kama dawa yako kuu ya floraidi, na tegemea tyubu moja ya gramu 75 imtoshe mtu mzima kwa takriban wiki tano. Damu inayoendelea baada ya wiki mbili za kupiga mswaki vizuri, meno yanayolegea au harufu mbaya ya kinywa isiyoisha vinahitaji daktari wa meno, na dawa za kung’arisha haziwezi kubadilisha rangi asili ya meno. Afya Basics inazitoa kama hatua rahisi ya kupanda kutoka dawa ya kawaida, pamoja na ushauri wa wazi ili mteja anunue inayomfaa."],["Adds margin above basic paste and answers a very common customer worry","Huongeza faida juu ya dawa ya kawaida na hujibu wasiwasi wa kawaida wa wateja"]],"pc_oral_tpk":[["Children’s toothpastes have a milder flavour so young children accept brushing, but they must still contain fluoride to prevent early childhood caries, which is common in Tanzanian under-fives. Use a smear the size of a grain of rice from the first tooth to age three and a pea-sized amount from three to six, and brush for the child until about age seven. A 50 ml tube used twice a day lasts one child about two months. Choose a paste that states its fluoride content, keep tubes out of reach so children do not eat them, and avoid sugary or fluoride-free “training” pastes for daily use. Afya pairs kids’ paste with kids’ brushes because parents buy them together at every school-term start.","Dawa za meno za watoto zina ladha hafifu ili watoto wadogo wakubali kupigwa mswaki, lakini lazima ziwe na floraidi ili kuzuia kuoza kwa meno ya utotoni, tatizo la kawaida kwa watoto wa chini ya miaka mitano Tanzania. Tumia kiasi cha punje ya mchele tangu jino la kwanza hadi miaka mitatu, na kiasi cha punje ya njegere kuanzia miaka mitatu hadi sita, na mpigie mtoto mswaki mwenyewe hadi afikie takriban miaka saba. Tyubu ya mililita 50 ikitumiwa mara mbili kwa siku humtosha mtoto mmoja kwa takriban miezi miwili. Chagua dawa inayoonyesha kiwango cha floraidi, weka tyubu mbali na watoto wasije wakaila, na epuka dawa zenye sukari au zisizo na floraidi kwa matumizi ya kila siku. Afya Basics huweka dawa ya watoto karibu na miswaki ya watoto kwa sababu wazazi huzinunua pamoja kila mwanzo wa muhula wa shule."],["A natural add-on to every kids’ brush and a school-term best seller","Nyongeza ya kawaida kwa kila mswaki wa mtoto na bidhaa inayouzwa sana mwanzo wa muhula"]],"pc_oral_tbm":[["A good manual toothbrush has a small head that reaches the back teeth, rounded bristles and a comfortable handle; medium bristles suit most adults with healthy gums. Dentists advise replacing the brush every three months, or sooner once the bristles splay, so a family of four needs about sixteen brushes a year, and multipacks offer the best value. Brush for two minutes twice a day, angling the bristles towards the gum line, and keep brushes upright to air-dry, apart from other family members’ brushes. Choose sealed, branded brushes and avoid unbranded loose brushes with sharp, uncut bristles that can damage gums. Afya keeps a value brush for every pocket and a better-built option for customers who want more comfort.","Mswaki mzuri wa mkono una kichwa kidogo kinachofikia meno ya nyuma, nyuzi zenye ncha za mviringo na mpini unaoshikika vizuri; nyuzi za kati zinawafaa watu wazima wengi wenye fizi zenye afya. Madaktari wa meno hushauri kubadilisha mswaki kila miezi mitatu, au mapema zaidi nyuzi zinapotawanyika, kwa hiyo familia ya watu wanne inahitaji takriban miswaki kumi na sita kwa mwaka, na pakiti za miswaki mingi ni nafuu zaidi. Piga mswaki kwa dakika mbili mara mbili kwa siku, ukielekeza nyuzi kuelekea kwenye fizi, na weka miswaki ikiwa imesimama ikauke hewani, mbali na miswaki ya wanafamilia wengine. Chagua miswaki iliyofungwa na yenye chapa, na epuka miswaki isiyo na chapa yenye nyuzi kali ambazo zinaweza kuumiza fizi. Afya Basics ina mswaki wa bei nafuu kwa kila mfuko na mswaki bora zaidi kwa wateja wanaotaka faraja zaidi."],["Low price, very high frequency: the easiest add-on at the till","Bei ndogo na hununuliwa mara nyingi sana: nyongeza rahisi zaidi kaunta"]],"pc_oral_tbs":[["Soft and extra-soft brushes clean plaque just as well as medium brushes when used correctly, but they are far kinder to sensitive teeth, receding gums and gum disease. Many dentists now recommend soft bristles for almost everyone, because brushing too hard with stiff bristles wears enamel and pushes gums back. Replace every three months, and use small circular movements rather than hard side-to-side scrubbing. People with braces, recent gum treatment or diabetes, who are more prone to gum problems, benefit most. Afya stocks soft brushes beside sensitive toothpaste so customers can solve the problem in one visit.","Miswaki laini na laini zaidi husafisha plaque vizuri sawa na miswaki ya kati inapotumiwa ipasavyo, lakini ni salama zaidi kwa meno yanayouma, fizi zilizoshuka na ugonjwa wa fizi. Madaktari wengi wa meno sasa hupendekeza nyuzi laini karibu kwa kila mtu, kwa sababu kusugua kwa nguvu kwa nyuzi ngumu huchakaza enameli na kusukuma fizi nyuma. Badilisha kila miezi mitatu, na tumia mizunguko midogo badala ya kusugua kwa nguvu upande hadi upande. Watu wenye vyuma vya meno, waliotibiwa fizi hivi karibuni au wenye kisukari, ambao huathirika zaidi na matatizo ya fizi, hunufaika zaidi. Afya Basics huweka miswaki laini karibu na dawa za meno yanayouma ili mteja atatue tatizo lake kwa ziara moja."],["Pairs with sensitive paste for a higher-value oral-care basket","Huenda pamoja na dawa ya meno yanayouma na kuongeza thamani ya kikapu"]],"pc_oral_tbk":[["Children’s brushes are sized by age, with a small soft head and a chunky handle that is easy for both parent and child to hold. Pick the stage that matches the child’s age on the pack, replace it every three months or after an illness, and let older children brush first while a parent finishes the job. Bright colours and characters help children brush for the full two minutes, but bristle softness and head size matter most. Store brushes upright and separate to dry, and never share brushes between children. Afya stocks a value brush and a premium staged brush because parents replace them often, especially at the start of each school term.","Miswaki ya watoto hupangwa kwa umri, ikiwa na kichwa kidogo laini na mpini mnene unaoshikika kwa urahisi na mzazi na mtoto. Chagua hatua inayolingana na umri wa mtoto kama ilivyoandikwa kwenye pakiti, ibadilishe kila miezi mitatu au baada ya ugonjwa, na waache watoto wakubwa wapige mswaki kwanza kisha mzazi amalizie. Rangi angavu na picha za wahusika huwasaidia watoto kupiga mswaki kwa dakika mbili kamili, lakini ulaini wa nyuzi na ukubwa wa kichwa ndivyo muhimu zaidi. Weka miswaki ikiwa imesimama na ikiwa mbali mbali ili ikauke, na watoto wasishirikiane mswaki. Afya Basics ina mswaki wa bei nafuu na mswaki bora wa hatua kwa hatua kwa sababu wazazi huibadilisha mara kwa mara, hasa mwanzo wa kila muhula wa shule."],["Frequent replacement and a strong school-term and gifting item","Hubadilishwa mara kwa mara na huuzwa sana mwanzo wa muhula na kama zawadi"]],"pc_oral_tbe":[["Powered toothbrushes move the bristles for you, and good evidence shows they remove slightly more plaque than manual brushing, which helps people with arthritis, braces or poor technique. Battery “sonic” brushes are an affordable entry point, while rechargeable models with timers and pressure sensors suit long-term users. Replace the brush head every three months and keep the handle dry between uses; check that replacement heads are easy to find before buying. Guide the brush slowly along each tooth rather than scrubbing, as the motor does the work. Afya offers a powered option because it is an aspirational gift and lifts the value of the oral-care basket.","Miswaki inayotumia nguvu ya betri au umeme huzungusha nyuzi kwa niaba yako, na ushahidi mzuri unaonyesha huondoa plaque kidogo zaidi kuliko kupiga mswaki kwa mkono, jambo linalowasaidia wenye baridi yabisi, vyuma vya meno au wasiojua kupiga mswaki vizuri. Miswaki ya betri ya aina ya “sonic” ni mwanzo wa bei nafuu, na miswaki inayochajiwa yenye kipima muda na kihisi cha nguvu inawafaa watumiaji wa muda mrefu. Badilisha kichwa cha mswaki kila miezi mitatu na weka mpini ukiwa mkavu kati ya matumizi; hakikisha vichwa vya kubadilisha vinapatikana kwa urahisi kabla ya kununua. Ongoza mswaki taratibu juu ya kila jino badala ya kusugua, kwani mota hufanya kazi hiyo. Afya Basics inatoa mswaki wa aina hii kwa sababu ni zawadi inayotamaniwa na huongeza thamani ya kikapu cha utunzaji wa kinywa."],["High value per sale and a popular gift","Thamani kubwa kwa kila mauzo na zawadi inayopendwa"]],"pc_oral_flo":[["A toothbrush cannot reach between teeth, where decay and gum disease often begin; cleaning between teeth once a day with floss removes that hidden plaque. Waxed floss slides more easily between tight teeth, and expanding or tape floss is gentler on sensitive gums. Use about 40 cm, wrap it around the middle fingers and curve it in a C shape around each tooth, sliding just under the gum line. A 50 m reel lasts one person roughly six weeks of daily use. Afya stocks own-label and branded floss at different prices, as floss is light, small and highly profitable to add to every oral-care sale.","Mswaki haufiki katikati ya meno, mahali ambapo kuoza na ugonjwa wa fizi mara nyingi huanzia; kusafisha katikati ya meno mara moja kwa siku kwa uzi huondoa plaque hiyo iliyojificha. Uzi wenye nta huteleza kwa urahisi kati ya meno yaliyobanana, na uzi unaopanuka au uzi bapa ni laini zaidi kwa fizi zinazouma. Tumia takriban sentimita 40, zungusha kwenye vidole vya kati na upinde kwa umbo la C kuzunguka kila jino, ukiuteremsha kidogo chini ya fizi. Kifurushi cha mita 50 humtosha mtu mmoja kwa takriban wiki sita za matumizi ya kila siku. Afya Basics ina uzi wa chapa yake na wa chapa nyingine kwa bei tofauti, kwa sababu uzi ni mwepesi, mdogo na wenye faida kubwa ukiongezwa kwenye kila mauzo ya utunzaji wa kinywa."],["Tiny, light and high-margin: easy to add to every oral-care sale","Ndogo, nyepesi na yenye faida kubwa: rahisi kuongeza kwenye kila mauzo ya kinywa"]],"pc_oral_idb":[["Interdental brushes are tiny bottle-brushes that clean between teeth, and studies show they remove more plaque than floss where gaps are wide enough. They come in colour-coded sizes; the right size fits snugly without forcing, so many people need two sizes for different parts of the mouth. Use once a day, rinse after use and replace each brush when the wire bends or bristles flatten, usually after a week. They are especially useful for braces, bridges, implants and older adults with receding gums. Afya stocks them as a specialist upgrade that dentists recommend and customers come back to buy again.","Brashi ndogo za katikati ya meno ni kama brashi ndogo za kusafishia chupa zinazosafisha katikati ya meno, na tafiti zinaonyesha huondoa plaque zaidi kuliko uzi pale mapengo yanapokuwa mapana. Zinakuja kwa saizi zenye rangi tofauti; saizi sahihi huingia kwa kubana kidogo bila kulazimisha, hivyo watu wengi huhitaji saizi mbili kwa sehemu tofauti za kinywa. Tumia mara moja kwa siku, suuza baada ya kutumia na badilisha kila brashi waya unapopinda au nyuzi zinapolala, kwa kawaida baada ya wiki moja. Zinafaa sana kwa wenye vyuma vya meno, meno ya daraja, vipandikizi na wazee wenye fizi zilizoshuka. Afya Basics inazitoa kama bidhaa maalum inayopendekezwa na madaktari wa meno, na wateja hurudi kuzinunua tena."],["Dentist-recommended specialist item with steady repeat sales","Bidhaa maalum inayopendekezwa na madaktari wa meno yenye mauzo ya kurudiwa"]],"pc_oral_mw":[["Mouthwash adds to, but never replaces, brushing and cleaning between teeth. Fluoride mouthwashes help prevent decay, while antibacterial rinses with cetylpyridinium chloride or essential oils reduce plaque and freshen breath; alcohol-free formulas sting less and suit dry mouth. Use it at a different time from brushing, such as after lunch, so you do not rinse away the fluoride from your toothpaste, and do not swallow. A 250 ml bottle used once a day lasts about two weeks for one adult. Chlorhexidine and other medicated mouthwashes are for short-term use on a dentist’s or pharmacist’s advice. Afya stocks a value fluoride rinse and recognised brands at a higher price.","Dawa ya kusukutua huongeza, lakini haichukui nafasi ya, kupiga mswaki na kusafisha katikati ya meno. Dawa za kusukutua zenye floraidi husaidia kuzuia kuoza kwa meno, na zile za kuua bakteria zenye setilpiridiniamu kloraidi au mafuta asilia hupunguza plaque na kuburudisha pumzi; zisizo na pombe haziwashi sana na zinawafaa wenye kinywa kikavu. Itumie wakati tofauti na kupiga mswaki, kama baada ya chakula cha mchana, ili usiondoe floraidi ya dawa ya meno, na usiimeze. Chupa ya mililita 250 ikitumiwa mara moja kwa siku humtosha mtu mzima mmoja kwa takriban wiki mbili. Klorheksidini na dawa nyingine za kusukutua zenye dawa ni za matumizi ya muda mfupi kwa ushauri wa daktari wa meno au mfamasia. Afya Basics ina dawa ya floraidi ya bei nafuu na chapa zinazojulikana kwa bei ya juu zaidi."],["A liquid add-on with a good basket value and regular repeat buys","Nyongeza ya kimiminika yenye thamani nzuri na hununuliwa tena mara kwa mara"]],"pc_oral_brth":[["Most bad breath comes from bacteria on the back of the tongue, so a tongue cleaner used each morning is one of the simplest fixes. Sugar-free gum stimulates saliva, which protects teeth and freshens breath after meals, and saliva-replacement gels relieve dry mouth caused by medicines, diabetes or older age. Choose gum labelled sugar-free with xylitol where possible, and avoid sugary mints that feed decay. Breath that stays bad despite good cleaning may signal gum disease, sinus problems or diabetes and should be checked. Afya groups these together because customers with breath worries are discreet, loyal buyers, especially around Ramadan when fasting dries the mouth.","Harufu mbaya ya kinywa mara nyingi hutokana na bakteria walio nyuma ya ulimi, kwa hiyo kisafisha ulimi kinachotumiwa kila asubuhi ni suluhisho rahisi kuliko yote. Ubani (chingamu) usio na sukari huchochea mate, ambayo hulinda meno na kuburudisha pumzi baada ya kula, na jeli za kuongeza mate hupunguza ukavu wa kinywa unaosababishwa na dawa, kisukari au uzee. Chagua ubani ulioandikwa hauna sukari na wenye xylitol inapowezekana, na epuka peremende zenye sukari zinazochochea kuoza kwa meno. Harufu inayobaki licha ya usafi mzuri inaweza kuashiria ugonjwa wa fizi, matatizo ya sinasi au kisukari, na inapaswa kuchunguzwa. Afya Basics huziweka pamoja kwa sababu wateja wenye wasiwasi wa pumzi ni wanunuzi wa siri na waaminifu, hasa wakati wa Ramadhani ambapo kufunga hukausha kinywa."],["Impulse and discreet repeat buys with good margin","Manunuzi ya ghafla na ya siri yanayorudiwa, yenye faida nzuri"]],"pc_bath_bar":[["Ordinary soaps are alkaline and can strip the skin’s natural oils, leaving it tight and ashy, while “beauty bars” and syndet bars are closer to the skin’s pH and contain added moisturisers. They suit daily use on face and body, and are the better choice for dry, sensitive or eczema-prone skin. One 100 g bar lasts one adult about two to three weeks; keep it on a draining soap dish so it does not turn soft and wasteful. Avoid soaps that promise to lighten skin, as some unregistered products contain mercury or other banned agents. Afya stocks trusted gentle bars so families have an affordable step up from laundry-style soap.","Sabuni za kawaida zina alkali na zinaweza kuondoa mafuta asilia ya ngozi, na kuiacha ikibana na kuwa na weupe wa ukavu, ilhali sabuni za urembo na sabuni za “syndet” zinakaribiana na pH ya ngozi na zina vilainishi vya ziada. Zinafaa kwa matumizi ya kila siku usoni na mwilini, na ndizo chaguo bora kwa ngozi kavu, nyeti au yenye ukurutu. Kipande kimoja cha gramu 100 humtosha mtu mzima mmoja kwa takriban wiki mbili hadi tatu; kiweke kwenye kisahani kinachochuja maji ili kisilainike na kupotea bure. Epuka sabuni zinazoahidi kuchubua ngozi, kwani baadhi ya bidhaa zisizosajiliwa zina zebaki au kemikali nyingine zilizopigwa marufuku. Afya Basics ina sabuni laini zinazoaminika ili familia zipate hatua ya bei nafuu juu ya sabuni ya kufulia."],["Everyday staple with steady volume and a premium tier","Bidhaa ya kila siku yenye mauzo thabiti na daraja la hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_bath_anti":[["Antibacterial soaps clean as well as ordinary soap for most purposes, and the real protection comes from washing hands with soap and water for at least 20 seconds, especially after the toilet and before eating. Their fresh scent and familiar brands make them popular for family bathing during the hot season and in school-going households. They can be drying with frequent use, so people with eczema or very dry skin are better with a moisturising bar. A 175 g bar lasts a family hand-wash point around one to two weeks. Afya stocks the brands customers already trust so the basket is complete for hygiene-conscious families.","Sabuni za kuua bakteria husafisha sawa na sabuni ya kawaida kwa matumizi mengi, na kinga halisi hutokana na kunawa mikono kwa sabuni na maji kwa angalau sekunde 20, hasa baada ya kutoka chooni na kabla ya kula. Harufu yake safi na chapa zinazojulikana huzifanya zipendwe kwa kuoga familia wakati wa joto na katika kaya zenye watoto wa shule. Zinaweza kukausha ngozi zikitumiwa mara kwa mara, kwa hiyo wenye ukurutu au ngozi kavu sana wanafaa zaidi kutumia sabuni yenye kulainisha. Kipande cha gramu 175 hutosha sehemu ya kunawia mikono ya familia kwa takriban wiki moja hadi mbili. Afya Basics ina chapa ambazo wateja tayari wanaziamini ili kikapu kikamilike kwa familia zinazojali usafi."],["Fast-moving staple that brings households in every week","Bidhaa inayouzwa haraka inayoleta kaya dukani kila wiki"]],"pc_bath_sg":[["Shower gels and creams are liquid cleansers that rinse cleanly and are hygienic to share because no one touches the product. Creamy formulas with moisturisers suit dry skin and the cool dry season, while fresh gels suit oily skin and the hot season. A 500 ml bottle used by one adult daily lasts about a month; a pump bottle or a loofah makes it go further. People with eczema should choose fragrance-free formulas and avoid strongly perfumed gels. Afya stocks everyday family brands and a premium gifting tier because shower gel is one of the most frequently gifted personal-care items.","Jeli na krimu za kuogea ni visafishaji vya kimiminika vinavyoondoka kwa urahisi na ni salama kushirikiana kwa sababu hakuna anayegusa bidhaa yenyewe. Krimu zenye vilainishi zinafaa ngozi kavu na msimu wa baridi, na jeli zenye kuburudisha zinafaa ngozi yenye mafuta na msimu wa joto. Chupa ya mililita 500 ikitumiwa na mtu mzima kila siku hudumu kwa takriban mwezi mmoja; chupa yenye pampu au sponji ya kuogea huifanya idumu zaidi. Wenye ukurutu wachague zisizo na manukato na waepuke jeli zenye manukato makali. Afya Basics ina chapa za kawaida za familia pamoja na daraja la hadhi ya juu kwa zawadi, kwa sababu jeli za kuogea ni miongoni mwa bidhaa za utunzaji binafsi zinazotolewa zawadi mara nyingi zaidi."],["Regular buys plus strong festive and gift sales","Hununuliwa mara kwa mara na huuzwa sana wakati wa sikukuu na zawadi"]],"pc_bath_sens":[["People with eczema or very sensitive skin have a weaker skin barrier, and ordinary soaps and perfumes can trigger itching and flare-ups. Soap-free, fragrance-free “syndet” washes and bars clean without stripping the barrier and are often recommended by dermatologists alongside a thick moisturiser applied straight after bathing. Use lukewarm water, keep baths short and pat the skin dry rather than rubbing. A 400 ml bottle lasts one adult about five to six weeks. Afya stocks dermatologist brands for these customers because they are loyal, buy the matching moisturiser and value expert advice at the counter.","Watu wenye ukurutu au ngozi nyeti sana wana kinga dhaifu ya ngozi, na sabuni za kawaida na manukato vinaweza kuchochea muwasho na kurudi kwa ugonjwa. Visafishaji na sabuni za “syndet” zisizo na sabuni ya kawaida wala manukato husafisha bila kuondoa kinga ya ngozi, na mara nyingi hupendekezwa na madaktari wa ngozi pamoja na kilainishi kizito kinachopakwa mara baada ya kuoga. Tumia maji ya uvuguvugu, oga kwa muda mfupi na kausha ngozi kwa kugusa-gusa taulo badala ya kusugua. Chupa ya mililita 400 humtosha mtu mzima mmoja kwa takriban wiki tano hadi sita. Afya Basics ina chapa za madaktari wa ngozi kwa wateja hawa kwa sababu ni waaminifu, hununua kilainishi kinachoendana nacho na huthamini ushauri wa kitaalamu kaunta."],["High-value, loyal dermatology customer who buys the full routine","Mteja wa thamani kubwa na mwaminifu anayenunua mpangilio mzima wa utunzaji"]],"pc_bath_lot":[["Body lotion replaces the water and oils that the skin loses through washing, sun and wind, and is used by almost every Tanzanian household after bathing. Apply to damp skin within a few minutes of showering to lock in moisture; cocoa butter and shea lotions suit dry skin, while lighter lotions suit oily skin and the hot season. A 400 ml bottle lasts one adult about three to four weeks. Avoid lotions that promise lightening or “toning”, which may hide hydroquinone, steroids or mercury that damage skin and are banned in Tanzania. Afya stocks the family brands customers ask for by name, in large sizes that give better value.","Losheni ya mwili hurudisha maji na mafuta ambayo ngozi hupoteza kwa kuoga, jua na upepo, na hutumiwa na karibu kila kaya Tanzania baada ya kuoga. Ipake kwenye ngozi ikiwa bado na unyevu ndani ya dakika chache baada ya kuoga ili kufungia unyevu ndani; losheni za siagi ya kakao na shea zinafaa ngozi kavu, na losheni nyepesi zinafaa ngozi yenye mafuta na msimu wa joto. Chupa ya mililita 400 humtosha mtu mzima mmoja kwa takriban wiki tatu hadi nne. Epuka losheni zinazoahidi kuchubua au “kung’arisha” ngozi, kwani zinaweza kuficha haidrokwinoni, stiroidi au zebaki ambazo huharibu ngozi na zimepigwa marufuku Tanzania. Afya Basics ina chapa za familia ambazo wateja huziulizia kwa majina, kwa saizi kubwa zenye thamani bora."],["One of the highest-volume items in personal care, bought monthly","Mojawapo ya bidhaa zinazouzwa kwa wingi zaidi, hununuliwa kila mwezi"]],"pc_bath_dry":[["When ordinary lotion is not enough, intensive creams with ceramides, urea, glycerin or petrolatum rebuild the skin barrier and hold water in the skin for longer. Urea at 5–10% softens rough, scaly skin on legs and elbows, while ceramide creams suit eczema and sensitive skin. Apply twice a day, generously, especially after bathing; a 450 g tub lasts one adult around a month. Creams in tubs and pumps are thicker than lotions and work better on very dry areas. Afya stocks dermatologist-recommended creams because these customers need results, buy repeatedly and often add a gentle wash.","Losheni ya kawaida isipotosha, krimu nzito zenye seramaidi, yuria, gliserini au petrolatamu hujenga upya kinga ya ngozi na kushikilia maji ndani ya ngozi kwa muda mrefu zaidi. Yuria ya asilimia 5–10 hulainisha ngozi ngumu yenye magamba miguuni na kwenye viwiko, na krimu za seramaidi zinafaa ukurutu na ngozi nyeti. Paka mara mbili kwa siku kwa wingi, hasa baada ya kuoga; kopo la gramu 450 humtosha mtu mzima mmoja kwa takriban mwezi mmoja. Krimu za kwenye makopo na pampu ni nzito kuliko losheni na hufanya kazi vizuri zaidi kwenye sehemu kavu sana. Afya Basics ina krimu zinazopendekezwa na madaktari wa ngozi kwa sababu wateja hawa wanahitaji matokeo, hununua tena na tena, na mara nyingi huongeza kisafishaji laini."],["Premium, results-driven repeat purchase","Bidhaa ya hadhi ya juu inayonunuliwa tena kwa sababu ya matokeo"]],"pc_bath_jel":[["Pure petroleum jelly is one of the most effective and affordable skin protectants: it forms a seal that stops water escaping, so it heals dry, cracked skin, protects against chafing and soothes chapped lips. Use only a thin layer on damp skin, as more is not better, and choose triple-purified, registered brands rather than loose or unlabelled jelly. It is safe from babyhood to old age and is used in almost every Tanzanian home. A 100 ml tub lasts an adult a month or more. Afya stocks it in small and large sizes because it is a trusted staple with constant demand.","Mafuta mazito ya petroli (jelly) halisi ni mojawapo ya vilinda ngozi bora na vya bei nafuu zaidi: hutengeneza tabaka linalozuia maji kutoka, hivyo huponya ngozi kavu iliyopasuka, huzuia michubuko ya msuguano na hutuliza midomo iliyokauka. Tumia tabaka jembamba tu kwenye ngozi yenye unyevu, kwani kupaka zaidi hakuongezi faida, na chagua chapa zilizosajiliwa na kusafishwa mara tatu badala ya mafuta yanayouzwa kwa kipimo bila lebo. Ni salama tangu utotoni hadi uzeeni na hutumiwa karibu kila nyumba Tanzania. Kopo la mililita 100 humtosha mtu mzima kwa mwezi mmoja au zaidi. Afya Basics inaiuza kwa saizi ndogo na kubwa kwa sababu ni bidhaa ya msingi inayoaminika yenye mahitaji ya kudumu."],["Household staple with constant demand at a low price","Bidhaa ya msingi ya kila nyumba yenye mahitaji ya kudumu kwa bei ndogo"]],"pc_bath_but":[["Cocoa butter and shea butter are rich plant fats that soften and protect dry skin and are long trusted in East African skin care. Body butters and creams are thicker than lotions, so they suit elbows, knees and legs, the cool dry season and anyone with naturally dry skin. A small amount massaged into damp skin goes a long way; a 250 ml bottle lasts an adult about a month. Pure shea is fragrance-free and suits sensitive skin, while perfumed body butters are popular gifts. Afya offers everyday and luxury options because body butters sell both as a staple and as a gift.","Siagi ya kakao na siagi ya shea ni mafuta mazito ya mimea yanayolainisha na kulinda ngozi kavu, na yameaminiwa kwa muda mrefu katika utunzaji wa ngozi Afrika Mashariki. Krimu nzito za mwili (body butter) ni nzito kuliko losheni, kwa hiyo zinafaa viwiko, magoti na miguu, msimu wa baridi na yeyote mwenye ngozi kavu kwa asili. Kiasi kidogo kikisuguliwa kwenye ngozi yenye unyevu hutosha sehemu kubwa; chupa ya mililita 250 humtosha mtu mzima kwa takriban mwezi mmoja. Shea halisi haina manukato na inafaa ngozi nyeti, ilhali krimu nzito zenye manukato ni zawadi zinazopendwa. Afya Basics inatoa chaguo za kila siku na za kifahari kwa sababu krimu hizi huuzwa kama bidhaa ya kila siku na pia kama zawadi."],["Sells as both a staple and a gift, with a strong premium tier","Huuzwa kama bidhaa ya kila siku na kama zawadi, yenye daraja imara la hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_bath_scar":[["Stretch marks form when skin stretches quickly during pregnancy, puberty or weight change, and scars form as wounds heal. Specialist oils and massage lotions keep skin supple and may soften the look of marks, especially when massaged in twice a day from early pregnancy, though no product can promise to prevent or erase them. Apply only to healed, unbroken skin, and a 60 ml bottle lasts around four to six weeks of daily use. Raised, itchy or spreading scars, such as keloids, need a doctor. Afya stocks the leading brands because expectant mothers and teenagers ask for them by name and buy them repeatedly.","Michirizi (stretch marks) hutokea ngozi inapovutika haraka wakati wa ujauzito, kubalehe au mabadiliko ya uzito, na makovu hutokea vidonda vinapopona. Mafuta maalum na losheni za kusingwa huifanya ngozi iwe nyororo na huenda zikapunguza mwonekano wa alama, hasa zikisingwa mara mbili kwa siku tangu mwanzo wa ujauzito, ingawa hakuna bidhaa inayoweza kuahidi kuzuia au kufuta kabisa. Paka kwenye ngozi iliyopona isiyo na jeraha tu, na chupa ya mililita 60 hudumu takriban wiki nne hadi sita za matumizi ya kila siku. Makovu yaliyoinuka, yanayowasha au yanayoenea, kama keloidi, yanahitaji daktari. Afya Basics ina chapa zinazoongoza kwa sababu wajawazito na vijana huziulizia kwa majina na huzinunua tena na tena."],["Premium, high-margin item with loyal pregnancy customers","Bidhaa ya hadhi ya juu yenye faida kubwa na wateja waaminifu wajawazito"]],"pc_bath_lhs":[["Handwashing with soap is one of the cheapest and most effective ways to prevent diarrhoea and respiratory infections, and a pump bottle by the sink makes it easy for children to wash properly. Wet hands, lather for at least 20 seconds covering backs, thumbs and fingertips, rinse and dry. Refills and larger bottles cut the cost per wash, and a 500 ml bottle lasts a family sink about two weeks. Moisturising formulas help hands that are washed often. Afya stocks value refills alongside branded and premium pumps so every home and small business can keep soap at the sink.","Kunawa mikono kwa sabuni ni mojawapo ya njia za bei nafuu na bora zaidi za kuzuia kuhara na maambukizi ya njia ya hewa, na chupa yenye pampu karibu na sinki huwarahisishia watoto kunawa ipasavyo. Lowesha mikono, tengeneza povu kwa angalau sekunde 20 ukifunika migongo ya mikono, vidole gumba na ncha za vidole, suuza na kausha. Vijazo na chupa kubwa hupunguza gharama kwa kila unawaji, na chupa ya mililita 500 hutosha sinki la familia kwa takriban wiki mbili. Sabuni zenye vilainishi husaidia mikono inayonawa mara nyingi. Afya Basics ina vijazo vya bei nafuu pamoja na chupa za chapa na za hadhi ya juu ili kila nyumba na biashara ndogo iwe na sabuni sinkini."],["Steady volume from homes and small businesses, peaking in the rains","Mauzo thabiti kutoka nyumbani na biashara ndogo, yakiongezeka msimu wa mvua"]],"pc_bath_wip":[["Body wipes give a quick clean when a shower is not possible: on long bus journeys, at work in the heat, after sport or when caring for someone in bed. Choose alcohol-free, pH-balanced wipes for body use and keep antibacterial wipes for hands and surfaces. Large adult wipes are thicker and cover more skin, and resealable packs stop wipes drying out. Never flush wipes, as they block toilets and drains. Afya stocks pocket packs and large packs because wipes sell steadily to commuters, travellers and carers.","Wipes za mwili hutoa usafi wa haraka pale kuoga kunaposhindikana: katika safari ndefu za basi, kazini wakati wa joto, baada ya michezo au unapomhudumia mtu aliye kitandani. Chagua wipes zisizo na pombe na zenye pH iliyosawazishwa kwa matumizi ya mwili, na tumia wipes za kuua bakteria kwa mikono na nyuso za vitu. Wipes kubwa za watu wazima ni nene zaidi na hufunika ngozi zaidi, na pakiti zinazofungika tena huzuia wipes kukauka. Kamwe usizitupe chooni, kwani huziba vyoo na mifereji. Afya Basics ina pakiti ndogo za mfukoni na pakiti kubwa kwa sababu wipes huuzwa kwa kasi thabiti kwa wasafiri wa kila siku, wasafiri na walezi."],["Steady seller to commuters, travellers and carers","Huuzwa kwa kasi thabiti kwa wasafiri na walezi"]],"pc_bath_tis":[["Pocket tissues are a small daily essential for runny noses, spills and public toilets, and they help stop germs spreading when people cough or sneeze into a tissue and throw it away. Three-ply tissues are softer on sore noses during colds, while cheaper two-ply packs suit everyday bags. Buy in multipacks for school bags and cars. Teach children to bin used tissues and wash hands afterwards. Afya keeps them at the till because they are the ultimate low-price impulse buy.","Tishu za mfukoni ni hitaji dogo la kila siku kwa mafua, vitu vilivyomwagika na vyoo vya umma, na husaidia kuzuia vijidudu kusambaa pale watu wanapokohoa au kupiga chafya kwenye tishu na kuitupa. Tishu za tabaka tatu ni laini zaidi kwa pua zinazouma wakati wa mafua, na pakiti za tabaka mbili za bei nafuu zinafaa mifuko ya kila siku. Nunua pakiti nyingi kwa pamoja kwa mifuko ya shule na magari. Wafundishe watoto kutupa tishu zilizotumika kwenye pipa na kunawa mikono baadaye. Afya Basics huziweka kaunta kwa sababu ni bidhaa bora kabisa ya kununuliwa ghafla kwa bei ndogo."],["Top impulse item at the till, peaking in cold and rainy seasons","Bidhaa kuu ya kununuliwa ghafla kaunta, inayoongezeka msimu wa baridi na mvua"]],"pc_bath_spg":[["A bath puff or sponge makes shower gel lather further and gently lifts dead skin, while long-handled scrubbers and straps help people reach the back, including older adults. Natural loofahs are firmer and suit exfoliation once or twice a week; soft puffs suit daily use and sensitive skin. Rinse well and hang to dry after every use, and replace sponges every one to two months, as damp sponges grow bacteria and mould. Never share bath sponges, and avoid scrubbing broken skin or active acne. Afya stocks a value range because these are cheap, colourful add-ons that sell with every shower gel.","Kisugua cha povu au sponji hufanya jeli ya kuogea itoe povu zaidi na huondoa ngozi iliyokufa kwa upole, na visugua vyenye mpini mrefu au mikanda huwasaidia watu kufikia mgongo, wakiwemo wazee. Dodoki asilia ni ngumu zaidi na zinafaa kusugua ngozi mara moja au mbili kwa wiki; visugua laini vinafaa matumizi ya kila siku na ngozi nyeti. Suuza vizuri na tundika vikauke baada ya kila matumizi, na badilisha sponji kila mwezi mmoja hadi miwili, kwa sababu sponji zenye unyevu huota bakteria na ukungu. Kamwe usishirikiane sponji ya kuogea, na epuka kusugua ngozi yenye jeraha au chunusi zinazoendelea. Afya Basics ina aina za bei nafuu kwa sababu ni nyongeza ndogo zenye rangi zinazouzwa pamoja na kila jeli ya kuogea."],["Cheap, colourful add-on with every shower gel sale","Nyongeza ya bei ndogo yenye rangi inayouzwa na kila jeli ya kuogea"]],"pc_bath_scrub":[["Scrubs contain fine grains that remove dead skin, leaving the surface smoother and helping prevent ingrown hairs on shaved areas. Use them only once or twice a week with light pressure, never on broken skin, sunburn or active acne, and follow with moisturiser; over-scrubbing causes irritation and dark marks on darker skin. Choose fine, rounded grains for the face and coarser grains for elbows, knees and feet. A 300 ml tub lasts several months at this frequency. Afya stocks value and well-known scrubs because they add margin and pair naturally with lotions and shaving products.","Visugua (scrub) vina chembechembe ndogo zinazoondoa ngozi iliyokufa, na kuacha uso wa ngozi ukiwa laini zaidi na kusaidia kuzuia nywele kuota ndani kwenye sehemu zilizonyolewa. Vitumie mara moja au mbili tu kwa wiki kwa nguvu kidogo, kamwe usitumie kwenye ngozi yenye jeraha, iliyoungua kwa jua au yenye chunusi zinazoendelea, na fuatisha kilainishi; kusugua kupita kiasi husababisha muwasho na madoa meusi kwenye ngozi nyeusi. Chagua chembechembe ndogo za mviringo kwa uso na kubwa zaidi kwa viwiko, magoti na miguu. Kopo la mililita 300 hudumu miezi kadhaa kwa matumizi haya. Afya Basics ina visugua vya bei nafuu na vinavyojulikana kwa sababu huongeza faida na huenda pamoja na losheni na bidhaa za kunyoa."],["Margin-building add-on to lotion and shaving baskets","Nyongeza inayoongeza faida kwenye vikapu vya losheni na kunyoa"]],"pc_bath_cap":[["A shower cap protects braids, twists, wigs and fresh styles from steam and splashes, so they last longer between salon visits. Lined satin caps also reduce frizz and can double as a light sleep cover, while simple plastic caps are cheap and disposable for travel. Choose a cap with a firm but comfortable elastic that covers the hairline without leaving marks. Replace plastic caps when the elastic loosens and wash fabric caps weekly. Afya stocks low-cost and lined options as an easy add-on for the many customers who invest in braids and protective styles.","Kofia ya kuogea hulinda misuko, nywele zilizosokotwa, mawigi na mitindo mipya dhidi ya mvuke na maji yanayorushwa, ili idumu muda mrefu zaidi kati ya ziara za saluni. Kofia za satin zenye ndani laini pia hupunguza nywele kusimama na zinaweza kutumika kama kifuniko chepesi cha kulalia, ilhali kofia rahisi za plastiki ni za bei ndogo na za kutupa baada ya safari. Chagua kofia yenye elastiki imara lakini nzuri inayofunika mstari wa nywele bila kuacha alama. Badilisha kofia za plastiki elastiki inapolegea na osha kofia za kitambaa kila wiki. Afya Basics ina aina za bei ndogo na zenye ndani laini kama nyongeza rahisi kwa wateja wengi wanaowekeza kwenye misuko na mitindo ya kulinda nywele."],["Tiny-price add-on with high attachment to hair and bath sales","Nyongeza ya bei ndogo inayoambatana sana na mauzo ya nywele na kuogea"]],"pc_skin_fwg":[["A gentle face wash removes sweat, sunscreen and dust without stripping the skin, which matters in a hot, humid city where people wash often. Look for soap-free, fragrance-free or lightly fragranced gels and creams, and avoid harsh scrubs or bar soap on the face, which can cause dryness and dark patches. Wash twice a day with lukewarm water and pat dry; a 150 ml tube lasts about six to eight weeks. If cleansing leaves the face tight or stinging, the product is too strong. Afya stocks value and dermatologist brands so every customer can start a simple, safe routine.","Kisafishaji laini cha uso huondoa jasho, mafuta ya kuzuia jua na vumbi bila kuikausha ngozi, jambo muhimu katika jiji lenye joto na unyevu ambapo watu huosha uso mara nyingi. Tafuta jeli na krimu zisizo na sabuni, zisizo na manukato au zenye manukato hafifu, na epuka visugua vikali au sabuni ya kipande usoni, ambavyo vinaweza kusababisha ukavu na mabaka meusi. Osha mara mbili kwa siku kwa maji ya uvuguvugu na kausha kwa kugusa-gusa; tyubu ya mililita 150 hudumu takriban wiki sita hadi nane. Kisafishaji kikiacha uso ukibana au ukiwaka, ni kikali kupita kiasi. Afya Basics ina chapa za bei nafuu na za madaktari wa ngozi ili kila mteja aanze mpangilio rahisi na salama."],["Entry point to a skin-care routine and a regular repeat buy","Mlango wa kuanzia mpangilio wa utunzaji wa ngozi na hununuliwa tena mara kwa mara"]],"pc_skin_fwo":[["Acne-prone skin benefits from cleansers containing salicylic acid, benzoyl peroxide or zinc, which unclog pores and reduce acne bacteria. Use twice a day, massage for 30–60 seconds and rinse, and expect to wait six to eight weeks for results; scrubbing harder or washing more often makes acne worse. Benzoyl peroxide can bleach towels and pillowcases, so use white ones. On darker skin, picking spots leaves dark marks that last months, so gentle care and daily sunscreen matter. Afya stocks proven acne washes at several prices because teenagers and young adults are loyal, frequent buyers.","Ngozi yenye chunusi hunufaika na visafishaji vyenye asidi ya salisiliki, benzoili peroksaidi au zinki, ambavyo hufungua vinyweleo na kupunguza bakteria wa chunusi. Tumia mara mbili kwa siku, singa kwa sekunde 30–60 kisha suuza, na subiri wiki sita hadi nane kuona matokeo; kusugua kwa nguvu zaidi au kuosha mara nyingi zaidi huzidisha chunusi. Benzoili peroksaidi inaweza kufifisha rangi ya taulo na foronya, kwa hiyo tumia za rangi nyeupe. Kwenye ngozi nyeusi, kutumbua chunusi huacha madoa meusi yanayodumu miezi, kwa hiyo utunzaji wa upole na mafuta ya kuzuia jua kila siku ni muhimu. Afya Basics ina visafishaji vilivyothibitishwa kwa bei mbalimbali kwa sababu vijana ni wanunuzi waaminifu na wa mara kwa mara."],["Large, loyal teen and young-adult market with high repeat","Soko kubwa na aminifu la vijana linalonunua tena mara kwa mara"]],"pc_skin_fwh":[["Ceramide and hyaluronic-acid cleansers clean thoroughly while helping the skin barrier hold water, a good choice for combination skin and for people using acne or anti-ageing treatments that dry the skin. Foaming versions suit normal to oily skin and hydrating creams suit dry skin. Large 236 ml bottles last two to three months of twice-daily use, so the cost per wash is moderate despite the higher shelf price. Pair them with a moisturiser and daily sunscreen for a complete routine. Afya stocks them because skincare-savvy customers ask for these brands by name.","Visafishaji vyenye seramaidi na asidi ya haialuroniki husafisha vizuri huku vikisaidia kinga ya ngozi kushikilia maji, chaguo zuri kwa ngozi mchanganyiko na kwa watu wanaotumia dawa za chunusi au za kupunguza dalili za uzee zinazokausha ngozi. Aina za povu zinafaa ngozi ya kawaida hadi yenye mafuta, na krimu zenye unyevu zinafaa ngozi kavu. Chupa kubwa za mililita 236 hudumu miezi miwili hadi mitatu kwa matumizi ya mara mbili kwa siku, kwa hiyo gharama kwa kila uoshaji ni ya wastani licha ya bei ya juu. Viunganishe na kilainishi na mafuta ya kuzuia jua kila siku kwa mpangilio kamili. Afya Basics inazitoa kwa sababu wateja wanaofahamu utunzaji wa ngozi huziulizia kwa majina."],["Premium cleanser tier with loyal, high-value buyers","Daraja la juu la visafishaji lenye wanunuzi waaminifu wa thamani kubwa"]],"pc_skin_bpo":[["Benzoyl peroxide is one of the most effective over-the-counter acne treatments: it kills acne bacteria and helps unblock pores, and 2.5% works almost as well as 5% with less irritation. Apply a thin layer to the whole affected area once a day at first, building to twice a day, and expect some dryness and peeling in the first weeks. Use a moisturiser and sunscreen, avoid the eyes and lips, and remember it bleaches fabric. See a doctor for painful cysts, scarring or acne that does not improve after two to three months. Afya stocks these registered gels as the effective, affordable first step in acne care.","Benzoili peroksaidi ni mojawapo ya dawa bora zaidi za chunusi zinazouzwa bila agizo la daktari: huua bakteria wa chunusi na husaidia kufungua vinyweleo, na asilimia 2.5 hufanya kazi karibu sawa na asilimia 5 lakini kwa muwasho mdogo. Paka tabaka jembamba kwenye sehemu yote yenye chunusi mara moja kwa siku mwanzoni, kisha uongeze hadi mara mbili kwa siku, na tarajia ukavu na kubambuka kidogo katika wiki za mwanzo. Tumia kilainishi na mafuta ya kuzuia jua, epuka macho na midomo, na kumbuka hufifisha rangi ya nguo. Muone daktari kwa uvimbe wenye maumivu, makovu au chunusi zisizopungua baada ya miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Afya Basics ina jeli hizi zilizosajiliwa kama hatua ya kwanza yenye ufanisi na bei nafuu katika kutibu chunusi."],["Low-cost, effective treatment that brings acne customers back","Tiba ya bei ndogo yenye ufanisi inayowarudisha wateja wa chunusi"]],"pc_skin_mfc":[["A rich cream restores moisture to dry facial skin and protects it from wind, air-conditioning and harsh cleansers. Apply a pea-sized amount morning and night to clean, slightly damp skin, followed in the morning by sunscreen. Choose fragrance-free formulas if the skin is sensitive, and avoid any cream that claims to lighten or whiten skin, as these may contain banned agents. A 75 ml tube lasts about six weeks. Afya keeps affordable classics that customers trust alongside a gentle option for sensitive skin.","Krimu nzito hurudisha unyevu kwenye ngozi kavu ya uso na kuilinda dhidi ya upepo, viyoyozi na visafishaji vikali. Paka kiasi cha punje ya njegere asubuhi na usiku kwenye ngozi safi yenye unyevu kidogo, na asubuhi fuatisha mafuta ya kuzuia jua. Chagua zisizo na manukato kama ngozi ni nyeti, na epuka krimu yoyote inayodai kuchubua au kung’arisha ngozi, kwani inaweza kuwa na kemikali zilizopigwa marufuku. Tyubu ya mililita 75 hudumu takriban wiki sita. Afya Basics ina krimu za zamani zinazoaminika kwa bei nafuu pamoja na chaguo laini kwa ngozi nyeti."],["Trusted classics with steady demand year-round","Krimu za zamani zinazoaminika zenye mahitaji thabiti mwaka mzima"]],"pc_skin_mfl":[["Oily and acne-prone skin still needs moisture, especially when using drying acne treatments, but heavy creams can block pores and feel greasy in heat. Light lotions and gels labelled oil-free or non-comedogenic hydrate without shine. Use a small amount after cleansing, morning and night; in the morning a moisturiser with SPF can replace two steps. A 125 ml bottle lasts two to three months. Afya stocks light formulas so young customers with oily skin can complete a routine that does not trigger breakouts.","Ngozi yenye mafuta na chunusi bado inahitaji unyevu, hasa inapotumia dawa za chunusi zinazokausha, lakini krimu nzito zinaweza kuziba vinyweleo na kuhisi kunata wakati wa joto. Losheni nyepesi na jeli zilizoandikwa hazina mafuta au haziziba vinyweleo (non-comedogenic) hulainisha bila kung’aa kwa mafuta. Tumia kiasi kidogo baada ya kusafisha uso, asubuhi na usiku; asubuhi kilainishi chenye SPF kinaweza kuchukua nafasi ya hatua mbili. Chupa ya mililita 125 hudumu miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Afya Basics ina aina nyepesi ili wateja vijana wenye ngozi ya mafuta wakamilishe mpangilio usiochochea chunusi."],["Completes the acne routine and lifts basket value","Hukamilisha mpangilio wa chunusi na huongeza thamani ya kikapu"]],"pc_skin_spb":[["Dar es Salaam has a very high UV index all year, and sunscreen prevents sunburn, dark patches and skin cancer, which matters most for fair skin and people with albinism but also protects darker skin from uneven tone. Choose broad-spectrum SPF 30 or higher with UVA protection, apply about two tablespoons for the whole body 15 minutes before going out, and reapply every two hours and after swimming or sweating. A 200 ml bottle gives roughly six full-body applications, so beach families use one bottle in a weekend. Keep sunscreen below 25 °C, as heat breaks it down, and check the expiry date. Afya stocks reliable brands in family sizes and makes sunscreen visible during the hot season.","Dar es Salaam ina kiwango cha juu sana cha mionzi ya UV mwaka mzima, na mafuta ya kuzuia jua huzuia kuungua kwa jua, mabaka meusi na saratani ya ngozi, jambo muhimu zaidi kwa watu wenye ngozi nyeupe na wenye ualbino, lakini pia hulinda ngozi nyeusi dhidi ya rangi isiyo sawa. Chagua kinga ya wigo mpana (broad-spectrum) ya SPF 30 au zaidi yenye kinga ya UVA, paka takriban vijiko viwili vikubwa kwa mwili mzima dakika 15 kabla ya kutoka, na rudia kila saa mbili na baada ya kuogelea au kutoka jasho. Chupa ya mililita 200 hutosha takriban mara sita za kupaka mwili mzima, kwa hiyo familia ya ufukweni hutumia chupa moja kwa wikendi moja. Hifadhi mafuta ya kuzuia jua chini ya nyuzi joto 25, kwani joto huyaharibu, na angalia tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi. Afya Basics ina chapa za kuaminika kwa saizi za familia na huyaonyesha wazi wakati wa msimu wa joto."],["Seasonal peak with high ticket value and growing awareness","Kilele cha msimu, thamani kubwa kwa kila mauzo na uelewa unaoongezeka"]],"pc_skin_spf":[["Daily face sunscreen is the most important step for preventing and fading dark marks after acne, melasma in pregnancy and premature ageing, because UV and visible light darken pigment even through windows. Modern face fluids are light, matte and leave little or no white cast on darker skin; tinted formulas also protect against visible light. Use about two finger-lengths for the face and neck every morning and reapply when outdoors for long. A 50 ml bottle lasts about five to six weeks of daily use. Afya stocks a value serum and dermatologist fluids, with staff advice on which suits each skin type.","Mafuta ya kuzuia jua ya uso ya kila siku ndiyo hatua muhimu zaidi ya kuzuia na kufifisha madoa meusi baada ya chunusi, melasma ya ujauzito na dalili za mapema za uzee, kwa sababu mionzi ya UV na mwanga unaoonekana huzidisha weusi hata kupitia madirisha. Vimiminika vya kisasa vya uso ni vyepesi, havina kung’aa kwa mafuta na huacha weupe kidogo au kutoacha kabisa kwenye ngozi nyeusi; vyenye rangi pia hulinda dhidi ya mwanga unaoonekana. Tumia kiasi cha urefu wa vidole viwili kwa uso na shingo kila asubuhi na rudia unapokaa nje kwa muda mrefu. Chupa ya mililita 50 hudumu takriban wiki tano hadi sita za matumizi ya kila siku. Afya Basics ina seramu ya bei nafuu na vimiminika vya madaktari wa ngozi, pamoja na ushauri wa wafanyakazi kuhusu kinachofaa kila aina ya ngozi."],["Fast-growing premium category tied to the dark-spot concern","Kundi la hadhi ya juu linalokua kwa kasi, linalohusiana na tatizo la madoa meusi"]],"pc_skin_alb":[["People with albinism lack melanin, so their skin and eyes have almost no natural protection, and skin cancer is the leading health threat for this community in Tanzania. Daily SPF 50+ broad-spectrum sunscreen, applied generously and reapplied every two hours, combined with long sleeves, wide-brimmed hats and UV-protective sunglasses, prevents most damage. Water-resistant lotions and sprays suit children and outdoor work, and a family typically needs one 200 ml bottle every two to three weeks. Any sore, scaly patch or growth that does not heal should be checked at a skin clinic promptly. Afya keeps SPF 50+ in stock at all times and in large sizes, because a reliable, fairly priced supply is a matter of health, not cosmetics.","Watu wenye ualbino hawana melanini, kwa hiyo ngozi na macho yao hayana kinga ya asili karibu kabisa, na saratani ya ngozi ndiyo tishio kuu la afya kwa jamii hii Tanzania. Mafuta ya kuzuia jua ya wigo mpana ya SPF 50+ yanayopakwa kila siku kwa wingi na kurudiwa kila saa mbili, pamoja na mikono mirefu, kofia pana na miwani yenye kinga ya UV, huzuia madhara mengi. Losheni na spree zisizotoka kwa maji zinafaa watoto na kazi za nje, na familia kwa kawaida inahitaji chupa moja ya mililita 200 kila wiki mbili hadi tatu. Kidonda chochote, baka lenye magamba au uvimbe usiopona unapaswa kuchunguzwa haraka katika kliniki ya ngozi. Afya Basics huhakikisha SPF 50+ inapatikana wakati wote na kwa saizi kubwa, kwa sababu upatikanaji wa uhakika kwa bei nzuri ni suala la afya, si la urembo."],["Essential health need for a loyal community, building strong reputation","Hitaji muhimu la afya kwa jamii aminifu, linalojenga sifa nzuri ya duka"]],"pc_skin_dsp":[["Many customers want to fade dark marks, and safe ingredients such as niacinamide, vitamin C, alpha arbutin, azelaic acid and licorice can lighten spots gradually over 8–12 weeks without harming the skin. These products only work with daily sunscreen, and they do not change natural skin colour. Products containing mercury, high-dose hydroquinone or strong steroids, often sold as “toning” or “whitening” creams, are banned in Tanzania because they cause thinning, permanent dark patches, and kidney and nerve damage. Apply a few drops once or twice daily after cleansing; a 30 ml bottle lasts about two months. Afya stocks only registered, evidence-based serums and gives honest advice, building trust in a market full of unsafe products.","Wateja wengi wanataka kufifisha madoa meusi, na viambato salama kama niacinamide, vitamini C, alfa arbutin, asidi ya azelaiki na licorice vinaweza kufifisha madoa taratibu ndani ya wiki 8–12 bila kudhuru ngozi. Bidhaa hizi hufanya kazi tu pamoja na mafuta ya kuzuia jua kila siku, na hazibadilishi rangi asili ya ngozi. Bidhaa zenye zebaki, haidrokwinoni nyingi au stiroidi kali, ambazo mara nyingi huuzwa kama krimu za “kung’arisha” au “kuchubua”, zimepigwa marufuku Tanzania kwa sababu husababisha ngozi kuwa nyembamba, mabaka meusi ya kudumu, na madhara ya figo na neva. Paka matone machache mara moja au mbili kwa siku baada ya kusafisha uso; chupa ya mililita 30 hudumu takriban miezi miwili. Afya Basics huuza seramu zilizosajiliwa na zenye ushahidi wa kisayansi pekee na hutoa ushauri wa kweli, na hivyo kujenga imani katika soko lililojaa bidhaa zisizo salama."],["High-margin category where honest advice builds lasting trust","Kundi lenye faida kubwa ambapo ushauri wa kweli hujenga imani ya kudumu"]],"pc_skin_mic":[["Micellar water contains tiny oil-attracting particles that lift make-up, sunscreen and grime onto a cotton pad without rubbing or rinsing, making it the gentlest first step of evening cleansing. Oil-infused versions remove waterproof make-up, while plain formulas suit sensitive skin. Soak a cotton pad, hold it on the eyes for a few seconds and wipe gently, then follow with a face wash if the skin is oily. A 400 ml bottle lasts around three months of nightly use. Afya stocks value and branded micellar waters next to cotton pads, as they sell together.","Maji ya micellar yana chembechembe ndogo zinazovuta mafuta, ambazo huondoa vipodozi, mafuta ya kuzuia jua na uchafu kwenye pamba bila kusugua wala kusuuza, hivyo ni hatua ya kwanza laini kabisa ya kusafisha uso jioni. Aina zenye mafuta huondoa vipodozi visivyotoka kwa maji, na aina za kawaida zinafaa ngozi nyeti. Lowesha pamba, ishikilie juu ya macho kwa sekunde chache na pangusa kwa upole, kisha tumia kisafishaji cha uso kama ngozi ina mafuta. Chupa ya mililita 400 hudumu takriban miezi mitatu ya matumizi ya kila usiku. Afya Basics ina maji ya micellar ya bei nafuu na ya chapa karibu na pamba za uso, kwa sababu huuzwa pamoja."],["Pairs with cotton pads and appeals to young urban women","Huenda pamoja na pamba za uso na huwavutia wanawake vijana wa mjini"]],"pc_skin_cot":[["Cotton wool and pre-cut pads are household basics for removing make-up, applying lotions and cleaning delicate skin. Choose 100% absorbent cotton from registered brands; pleated rolls let you tear the size you need, while round pads are neater for the face. Keep the pack sealed and dry to stay clean, and never leave cotton fibres in wounds or ears. A 100 g pack lasts a household around a month. Afya keeps small, cheap packs and larger value packs because cotton sells with almost every skin and baby purchase.","Pamba na pamba za uso zilizokatwa tayari ni mahitaji ya msingi nyumbani kwa kuondoa vipodozi, kupaka losheni na kusafisha ngozi laini. Chagua pamba asilia asilimia 100 inayofyonza kutoka kwa chapa zilizosajiliwa; mikunjo ya pamba hukuruhusu kukata kiasi unachohitaji, na pamba za mviringo ni nadhifu zaidi kwa uso. Weka pakiti ikiwa imefungwa na kavu ili ibaki safi, na kamwe usiache nyuzi za pamba kwenye vidonda au masikio. Pakiti ya gramu 100 hutosha kaya kwa takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya Basics ina pakiti ndogo za bei nafuu na pakiti kubwa zenye thamani kwa sababu pamba huuzwa pamoja na karibu kila manunuzi ya ngozi na mtoto."],["Low-price basic that rides along with skin and baby purchases","Bidhaa ya msingi ya bei ndogo inayonunuliwa pamoja na bidhaa za ngozi na mtoto"]],"pc_skin_sooth":[["Calamine lotion and aloe vera gel cool and calm skin that is itchy or irritated from heat rash, mild sunburn or insect bites, which are common in the Dar es Salaam hot season. Shake calamine well and dab it on with cotton; apply aloe gel thinly and keep it in the fridge for extra cooling. Prevent prickly heat with loose cotton clothing, cool showers and avoiding heavy creams on sweaty skin. Blistering sunburn, fever, or a rash that spreads or is very painful needs medical advice. Afya stocks these cheap, trusted soothers and promotes them at the start of the hot season.","Losheni ya kalamini na jeli ya aloe vera hupoza na kutuliza ngozi inayowasha au iliyokereka kwa vipele vya joto, kuungua kidogo kwa jua au kuumwa na wadudu, mambo ya kawaida wakati wa joto Dar es Salaam. Tikisa kalamini vizuri na ipake kwa pamba; paka jeli ya aloe kwa tabaka jembamba na ihifadhi kwenye jokofu ili ipoze zaidi. Zuia vipele vya joto kwa kuvaa nguo za pamba zilizolegea, kuoga maji baridi na kuepuka krimu nzito kwenye ngozi yenye jasho. Kuungua kwa jua kwenye malengelenge, homa, au vipele vinavyoenea au vyenye maumivu makali vinahitaji ushauri wa kitabibu. Afya Basics ina vituliza hivi vya bei ndogo vinavyoaminika na huvitangaza mwanzo wa msimu wa joto."],["Cheap seasonal seller that answers a very common hot-season need","Bidhaa ya msimu ya bei ndogo inayojibu hitaji la kawaida sana la msimu wa joto"]],"pc_hair_shp":[["Natural coily hair is drier than straight hair because scalp oils travel down the curl slowly, so it needs a moisturising shampoo used every one to two weeks rather than daily. Focus shampoo on the scalp, let the lather run down the lengths and always follow with conditioner. Large 400–500 ml bottles give the best value for families and last about two months. Avoid washing with bar or laundry soap, which leaves hair dry and brittle. Afya stocks value and mid-range shampoos because hair care is a weekly ritual in almost every home.","Nywele asilia za kipilipili ni kavu kuliko nywele zilizonyooka kwa sababu mafuta ya ngozi ya kichwa hushuka polepole kwenye mawimbi, kwa hiyo zinahitaji shampuu yenye kulainisha inayotumiwa kila wiki moja hadi mbili badala ya kila siku. Elekeza shampuu kwenye ngozi ya kichwa, acha povu litiririke kwenye nywele, na kila mara fuatisha kilainishi (conditioner). Chupa kubwa za mililita 400–500 ni nafuu zaidi kwa familia na hudumu takriban miezi miwili. Epuka kuosha kwa sabuni ya kipande au ya kufulia, ambayo huacha nywele kavu na zinazokatika. Afya Basics ina shampuu za bei nafuu na za kati kwa sababu utunzaji wa nywele ni desturi ya kila wiki karibu kila nyumba."],["Weekly ritual with steady volume and good basket attachment","Desturi ya kila wiki yenye mauzo thabiti na huvuta bidhaa nyingine kikapuni"]],"pc_hair_sfs":[["Sulfate-free shampoos use milder cleansers that clean the scalp without stripping the natural oils that coily hair needs, so curls stay softer and tangle less. They lather less, which is normal, and they suit people who wash weekly and use leave-in conditioners and oils. Use a clarifying shampoo once a month if products build up. A 350–600 ml bottle lasts two to three months. Afya stocks these because the natural-hair movement has made them a fast-growing, higher-value category.","Shampuu zisizo na salfeti hutumia visafishaji laini vinavyosafisha ngozi ya kichwa bila kuondoa mafuta asilia yanayohitajika na nywele za kipilipili, kwa hiyo mawimbi hubaki laini na hayachanganyiki sana. Hutoa povu kidogo, jambo la kawaida, na zinawafaa wanaoosha kila wiki na kutumia vilainishi vya kuacha nywele na mafuta. Tumia shampuu ya kusafisha kwa kina mara moja kwa mwezi kama bidhaa zimejikusanya. Chupa ya mililita 350–600 hudumu miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Afya Basics inazitoa kwa sababu harakati za nywele asilia zimezifanya kuwa kundi linalokua haraka lenye thamani kubwa."],["Fast-growing, higher-value natural-hair category","Kundi la nywele asilia linalokua haraka na lenye thamani kubwa zaidi"]],"pc_hair_cond":[["Conditioner smooths the hair cuticle after shampoo, making detangling easier and reducing breakage, which is the main cause of slow length retention in coily hair. Apply generously to the lengths, detangle gently with fingers or a wide-tooth comb, then rinse; once a week, leave a deep conditioner or treatment on under a plastic cap for 15–30 minutes. Protein treatments strengthen weak hair, while moisturising masks soften dry hair. A 450–500 ml tub lasts four to six weeks. Afya stocks value and premium conditioners because every shampoo sale should carry a conditioner.","Kilainishi (conditioner) hulainisha ganda la nje la nywele baada ya shampuu, hurahisisha kufumua nywele na hupunguza kukatika, ambacho ndicho chanzo kikuu cha nywele za kipilipili kutokua ndefu. Paka kwa wingi kwenye nywele, fumua kwa upole kwa vidole au chanuo lenye meno mapana, kisha suuza; mara moja kwa wiki, acha kilainishi cha kina au matibabu chini ya kofia ya plastiki kwa dakika 15–30. Matibabu ya protini huimarisha nywele dhaifu, na barakoa za kulainisha hulainisha nywele kavu. Kopo la mililita 450–500 hudumu wiki nne hadi sita. Afya Basics ina vilainishi vya bei nafuu na vya hadhi ya juu kwa sababu kila mauzo ya shampuu yanapaswa kwenda na kilainishi."],["Natural companion to every shampoo sale","Mwenzi wa kawaida wa kila mauzo ya shampuu"]],"pc_hair_li":[["Leave-in conditioners are light creams, lotions or sprays applied after washing and between wash days to keep coily hair moist, soft and easy to comb. They are the base of the popular “LOC” method: liquid or leave-in, then oil, then cream, which seals in moisture for days. Spray versions are ideal for refreshing braids and for children’s hair before combing. A 250–500 ml bottle lasts about a month. Afya stocks a range of trusted textured-hair brands because leave-ins are among the most repurchased hair products.","Vilainishi vya kuacha kwenye nywele ni krimu, losheni au spree nyepesi zinazopakwa baada ya kuosha na kati ya siku za kuosha ili kuweka nywele za kipilipili zikiwa na unyevu, laini na rahisi kuchana. Ndio msingi wa mbinu maarufu ya “LOC”: kimiminika au leave-in, kisha mafuta, kisha krimu, ambayo hufungia unyevu kwa siku kadhaa. Aina za spree ni bora kwa kuburudisha misuko na kwa nywele za watoto kabla ya kuchana. Chupa ya mililita 250–500 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya Basics ina chapa mbalimbali zinazoaminika za nywele za kipilipili kwa sababu leave-in ni miongoni mwa bidhaa za nywele zinazonunuliwa tena zaidi."],["One of the most repurchased hair products","Mojawapo ya bidhaa za nywele zinazonunuliwa tena zaidi"]],"pc_hair_crm":[["Curl creams and hair lotions add moisture and soft hold, helping natural curls clump and reducing frizz, while traditional hair foods seal the ends. Apply to damp hair in sections after a leave-in, then twist, braid or shingle for definition. Lighter lotions suit fine hair and heavier creams suit thick, very dry hair; build-up on the scalp means you are using too much. A 340–500 ml tub lasts four to eight weeks. Afya stocks value, mid and premium stylers because customers often buy two or three hair products together.","Krimu za mawimbi na losheni za nywele huongeza unyevu na kushikilia kwa ulaini, husaidia mawimbi asilia kukaa pamoja na kupunguza nywele kusimama, ilhali mafuta mazito ya kawaida ya nywele hufunga ncha. Paka kwenye nywele zenye unyevu kwa sehemu baada ya leave-in, kisha sokota, suka au paka kwa vidole ili kuonyesha mawimbi. Losheni nyepesi zinafaa nywele nyembamba na krimu nzito zinafaa nywele nene na kavu sana; bidhaa zikijikusanya kichwani maana yake unatumia nyingi kupita kiasi. Kopo la mililita 340–500 hudumu wiki nne hadi nane. Afya Basics ina vitengeneza mtindo vya bei nafuu, vya kati na vya hadhi ya juu kwa sababu wateja mara nyingi hununua bidhaa mbili au tatu za nywele kwa pamoja."],["Builds multi-item hair baskets at all price levels","Hujenga vikapu vya bidhaa nyingi za nywele kwa kila kiwango cha bei"]],"pc_hair_oil":[["Oils such as castor, coconut, argan, olive and jojoba seal moisture into hair after a water-based leave-in and soften dry ends; coconut oil also reduces protein loss when applied before washing. Use only a few drops at a time, as heavy oiling of the scalp can cause build-up and flaking. Black castor oil is popular for edges and scalp massage, though claims of rapid growth are not proven. Scalp itching, scaling or patchy hair loss need a doctor rather than more oil. Afya stocks pure oils in small, affordable bottles alongside branded blends.","Mafuta kama mbarika (castor), nazi, argan, zeituni na jojoba hufungia unyevu kwenye nywele baada ya leave-in yenye maji na hulainisha ncha kavu; mafuta ya nazi pia hupunguza upotevu wa protini yanapopakwa kabla ya kuosha. Tumia matone machache tu kwa wakati mmoja, kwani kupaka mafuta mengi kichwani kunaweza kusababisha kujikusanya na mba. Mafuta meusi ya mbarika yanapendwa kwa nywele za pembeni na kusinga ngozi ya kichwa, ingawa madai ya kukuza nywele haraka hayajathibitishwa. Muwasho wa ngozi ya kichwa, magamba au upotevu wa nywele kwa mabaka unahitaji daktari badala ya kuongeza mafuta. Afya Basics ina mafuta halisi kwa chupa ndogo za bei nafuu pamoja na michanganyiko ya chapa."],["Low-cost repeat item with premium natural-oil upsell","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo inayonunuliwa tena, yenye chaguo za mafuta asilia ya hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_hair_gel":[["Styling gels give hold for sleek ponytails, puffs and wash-and-go curls, and edge-control gels tame the hairline. Choose alcohol-free gels, which are less drying, and apply over a leave-in so hair stays moist underneath. Tight styles pulled back every day can cause traction alopecia, permanent thinning at the edges, so vary styles and avoid heavy brushing of the hairline. Wash gel out within a week to prevent flaking and build-up. Afya stocks a value gel and a curl-defining gel because styling products are frequent, low-ticket buys.","Jeli za kutengeneza nywele hushikilia mitindo ya kubana nywele, mitindo ya mpira juu ya kichwa na mawimbi ya kuosha na kwenda, na jeli za pembeni hutuliza nywele za mstari wa mbele. Chagua jeli zisizo na pombe, ambazo hukausha kidogo, na zipake juu ya leave-in ili nywele zibaki na unyevu ndani. Mitindo inayobana nywele kila siku inaweza kusababisha upotevu wa nywele kwa kuvutwa (traction alopecia), yaani kupungua kwa nywele za pembeni kwa kudumu, kwa hiyo badilisha mitindo na epuka kuchana kwa nguvu mstari wa nywele. Osha jeli ndani ya wiki moja ili kuzuia mba na kujikusanya. Afya Basics ina jeli ya bei nafuu na jeli ya kuonyesha mawimbi kwa sababu bidhaa za mitindo hununuliwa mara kwa mara kwa bei ndogo."],["Frequent low-ticket buy popular with students and young adults","Hununuliwa mara kwa mara kwa bei ndogo, maarufu kwa wanafunzi na vijana"]],"pc_hair_dan":[["Dandruff is caused mainly by an overgrowth of a normal scalp yeast and is worse with infrequent washing, heavy oils and long-worn braids. Medicated shampoos containing selenium sulphide, zinc pyrithione or ketoconazole should be massaged into the scalp and left for three to five minutes before rinsing, used twice a week for a month and then weekly. Follow with conditioner on the lengths, as these shampoos can dry coily hair. Patches of hair loss with scaling in children may be ringworm (tinea capitis), which needs a doctor and oral treatment. Afya stocks value and pharmacy options so customers get relief without guesswork.","Mba husababishwa hasa na kuongezeka kwa hamira (yeast) ya kawaida ya ngozi ya kichwa, na huzidi kwa kutoosha mara kwa mara, mafuta mazito na misuko inayokaa muda mrefu. Shampuu zenye dawa kama seleniamu salfaidi, zinki pirithioni au ketokonazoli zisingwe kwenye ngozi ya kichwa na kuachwa kwa dakika tatu hadi tano kabla ya kusuuza, zitumike mara mbili kwa wiki kwa mwezi mmoja kisha mara moja kwa wiki. Fuatisha kilainishi kwenye nywele, kwa sababu shampuu hizi zinaweza kukausha nywele za kipilipili. Mabaka ya kupotea nywele yenye magamba kwa watoto yanaweza kuwa mashilingi (tinea capitis), yanayohitaji daktari na dawa ya kumeza. Afya Basics ina chaguo za bei nafuu na za famasia ili wateja wapate nafuu bila kubahatisha."],["Problem-solving product with strong repeat use","Bidhaa ya kutatua tatizo yenye matumizi ya kurudiwa"]],"pc_hair_spr":[["Braid and sheen sprays add a light layer of moisture and shine to braids, twists and locs and soothe the itchy, tight feeling of fresh styles. Spray lightly on the scalp and lengths every two to three days rather than daily, as heavy use causes build-up. Look for sprays with water, glycerin and light oils rather than heavy mineral oils for the scalp. Keep aerosols away from flames and heat. Afya stocks these because protective styles are worn by a large share of women and girls, and sprays are bought throughout the life of each style.","Spree za misuko na za kung’arisha huongeza tabaka jepesi la unyevu na mng’ao kwenye misuko, nywele zilizosokotwa na rasta, na hutuliza muwasho na hisia ya kubana ya mitindo mipya. Nyunyiza kidogo kwenye ngozi ya kichwa na nywele kila siku mbili hadi tatu badala ya kila siku, kwani matumizi mengi husababisha kujikusanya. Tafuta spree zenye maji, gliserini na mafuta mepesi badala ya mafuta mazito ya madini kwa ngozi ya kichwa. Weka spree za gesi mbali na moto na joto. Afya Basics inazitoa kwa sababu mitindo ya kulinda nywele huvaliwa na sehemu kubwa ya wanawake na wasichana, na spree hununuliwa katika kipindi chote cha kila mtindo."],["Bought repeatedly through the life of every protective style","Hununuliwa mara kwa mara katika kipindi chote cha kila mtindo wa kulinda nywele"]],"pc_hair_kid":[["Children’s scalps are more sensitive and their coily hair tangles easily, so a gentle detangler, mild wash and light oil make combing painless and reduce tears on school mornings. Spray or smooth detangler onto damp hair, divide into sections and comb from the ends upwards with a wide-tooth comb. Avoid adult relaxers and strong chemicals for young children, and do not make braids or ponytails so tight that they pull the hairline. A 250 ml detangler lasts about a month. Afya stocks kids’ ranges at fair prices because parents buy them every school term.","Ngozi ya kichwa ya watoto ni nyeti zaidi na nywele zao za kipilipili huchanganyika kwa urahisi, kwa hiyo kilainishi laini cha kufumua, shampuu laini na mafuta mepesi hufanya kuchana kusiwe na maumivu na hupunguza vilio asubuhi za shule. Nyunyiza au paka kilainishi cha kufumua kwenye nywele zenye unyevu, gawa kwa sehemu na chana kuanzia ncha kwenda juu kwa chanuo lenye meno mapana. Epuka dawa za kunyoosha nywele za watu wazima na kemikali kali kwa watoto wadogo, na usisuke wala kufunga nywele kwa kubana kiasi cha kuvuta mstari wa nywele. Kilainishi cha mililita 250 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya Basics ina bidhaa za watoto kwa bei nzuri kwa sababu wazazi huzinunua kila muhula wa shule."],["School-term repeat purchase for every family with young children","Hununuliwa kila muhula wa shule na kila familia yenye watoto wadogo"]],"pc_hair_comb":[["The right tool reduces breakage more than almost any product: wide-tooth combs and flexible detangling brushes glide through coily hair, while afro picks lift and shape without pulling. Always detangle damp, conditioned hair in sections, starting at the ends, and never force a fine-tooth comb through dry natural hair. Choose seamless combs with smooth teeth, as rough seams snag and split strands. Wash combs weekly and do not share them, to avoid spreading scalp infections. Afya stocks value combs and a premium brush because these are cheap, durable add-ons to every hair sale.","Kifaa sahihi hupunguza kukatika kwa nywele kuliko karibu bidhaa yoyote: machanuo yenye meno mapana na brashi zinazopinda za kufumua hupita kwa urahisi kwenye nywele za kipilipili, na chanuo za afro huinua na kutengeneza umbo bila kuvuta. Kila mara fumua nywele zenye unyevu zilizopakwa kilainishi kwa sehemu, ukianzia ncha, na kamwe usilazimishe chanuo lenye meno membamba kwenye nywele asilia kavu. Chagua machanuo yasiyo na mishono yenye meno laini, kwani mishono mikali hunasa na kupasua nywele. Osha machanuo kila wiki na usishirikiane nayo ili kuepuka kusambaza maambukizi ya ngozi ya kichwa. Afya Basics ina machanuo ya bei nafuu na brashi ya hadhi ya juu kwa sababu ni nyongeza za bei ndogo zinazodumu kwenye kila mauzo ya nywele."],["Durable, cheap add-on that lifts hair-aisle sales","Nyongeza ya bei ndogo inayodumu na kuongeza mauzo ya rafu ya nywele"]],"pc_hair_bon":[["Cotton pillowcases absorb moisture and create friction that dries and breaks coily hair, so sleeping in a satin or silk-lined bonnet keeps hair moisturised, reduces frizz and makes styles last longer. Choose a bonnet with a wide, soft band that fits without pressing on the edges, and a large size for braids or locs. Wash weekly, as oils and sweat build up. A good bonnet lasts six months or more. Afya stocks affordable bonnets because they are a near-universal need and a popular small gift.","Foronya za pamba hufyonza unyevu na kusababisha msuguano unaokausha na kukatisha nywele za kipilipili, kwa hiyo kulala ukiwa umevaa boneti ya satin au yenye ndani ya hariri huweka nywele zikiwa na unyevu, hupunguza nywele kusimama na hufanya mitindo idumu zaidi. Chagua boneti yenye mkanda mpana na laini unaokaa bila kubana nywele za pembeni, na saizi kubwa kwa misuko au rasta. Osha kila wiki, kwa sababu mafuta na jasho hujikusanya. Boneti nzuri hudumu miezi sita au zaidi. Afya Basics ina boneti za bei nafuu kwa sababu ni hitaji la karibu kila mwanamke na zawadi ndogo inayopendwa."],["Near-universal need and a popular small gift","Hitaji la karibu kila mtu na zawadi ndogo inayopendwa"]],"pc_hair_acc":[["Hair ties with metal joins and thin rubber bands snag and break natural hair, so choose seamless, fabric-covered or no-slip bands and wide clips. Use larger clips to section hair while washing and detangling, which makes wash day faster and gentler. Change positions of ponytails and puffs to avoid stress on the same spot of the hairline. Keep a spare pack in school bags, as children lose ties often. Afya stocks multi-packs as cheap, colourful add-ons.","Vibanio vyenye viungo vya chuma na mipira myembamba hunasa na kukatisha nywele asilia, kwa hiyo chagua vibanio visivyo na mishono, vilivyofunikwa kwa kitambaa au visivyoteleza, pamoja na pini pana. Tumia pini kubwa kugawa nywele wakati wa kuosha na kufumua, jambo linalofanya siku ya kuosha iwe ya haraka na ya upole zaidi. Badilisha mahali unapofunga nywele ili kuepuka kuvuta sehemu ile ile ya mstari wa nywele. Weka pakiti ya akiba kwenye mifuko ya shule, kwa sababu watoto hupoteza vibanio mara kwa mara. Afya Basics ina pakiti za vibanio vingi kama nyongeza za bei ndogo zenye rangi."],["Cheap, colourful impulse add-on","Nyongeza ya bei ndogo yenye rangi inayonunuliwa ghafla"]],"pc_deo_rw":[["Antiperspirants use aluminium salts to reduce sweat, while deodorants only mask or neutralise odour; in Dar es Salaam heat most customers want both. Apply to clean, dry underarms, ideally at night so the active works while sweat glands are quiet, and again in the morning if needed. A 50 ml roll-on lasts about four to six weeks of daily use. Choose 48-hour or “even tone” formulas if marks or darkening are a concern, and stop using any product that stings after shaving. Afya stocks the women’s brands customers ask for by name at value and mid prices.","Vizuia jasho (antiperspirants) hutumia chumvi za alumini kupunguza jasho, ilhali viondoa harufu (deodorants) hufunika au huondoa harufu tu; katika joto la Dar es Salaam wateja wengi wanataka vyote viwili. Paka kwenye kwapa safi na kavu, ikiwezekana usiku ili kiambato kifanye kazi wakati tezi za jasho zimetulia, na tena asubuhi ikihitajika. Roll-on ya mililita 50 hudumu takriban wiki nne hadi sita za matumizi ya kila siku. Chagua aina za saa 48 au za “rangi sawa” kama madoa au weusi wa kwapa ni wasiwasi, na acha kutumia bidhaa yoyote inayowasha baada ya kunyoa. Afya Basics ina chapa za wanawake ambazo wateja huziulizia kwa majina kwa bei nafuu na za kati."],["Daily-use hero with very high frequency in the hot season","Bidhaa kuu ya kila siku inayonunuliwa mara nyingi sana wakati wa joto"]],"pc_deo_rm":[["Men’s roll-ons usually have stronger fragrance and higher sweat-control claims for active, hot days. Apply to dry skin after showering, let it dry before dressing to avoid white marks, and reapply after sport if needed. Black-and-white or “invisible” formulas reduce marks on shirts, which is a frequent complaint. A 50 ml roll-on lasts about a month. Afya stocks the leading men’s brands at accessible prices because men tend to stay with one brand and buy it every month.","Roll-on za wanaume kwa kawaida zina manukato makali zaidi na madai ya juu ya kudhibiti jasho kwa siku za joto na shughuli nyingi. Paka kwenye ngozi kavu baada ya kuoga, acha ikauke kabla ya kuvaa ili kuepuka madoa meupe, na rudia baada ya michezo ikihitajika. Aina za “black & white” au “invisible” hupunguza madoa kwenye mashati, tatizo linalolalamikiwa mara kwa mara. Roll-on ya mililita 50 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya Basics ina chapa zinazoongoza za wanaume kwa bei nafuu kwa sababu wanaume huwa wanabaki na chapa moja na kuinunua kila mwezi."],["Brand-loyal monthly repeat purchase","Hununuliwa kila mwezi na wateja waaminifu kwa chapa moja"]],"pc_deo_stk":[["Sticks glide on dry, need no drying time and are allowed in hand luggage, which makes them popular with travellers and gym users. Two or three swipes are enough; more leaves residue on clothes. Solid sticks last longer than roll-ons, often two months. Those with sensitive skin should test a new stick on a small area first. Afya stocks a value stick and the imported favourites customers ask for.","Stiki hupakwa zikiwa kavu, hazihitaji muda wa kukauka na zinaruhusiwa kwenye mizigo ya mkononi, jambo linalozifanya zipendwe na wasafiri na wanaofanya mazoezi. Kupitisha mara mbili au tatu kunatosha; zaidi ya hapo huacha mabaki kwenye nguo. Stiki ngumu hudumu zaidi ya roll-on, mara nyingi miezi miwili. Wenye ngozi nyeti wajaribu stiki mpya kwenye sehemu ndogo kwanza. Afya Basics ina stiki ya bei nafuu na zile za nje zinazopendwa ambazo wateja huziulizia."],["Higher-value alternative format with loyal fans","Aina mbadala yenye thamani kubwa na wapenzi waaminifu"]],"pc_deo_spr":[["Body sprays combine deodorant with a light fragrance and are popular with teenagers and young men for a quick refresh during the day. Hold the can 15 cm from the skin, spray briefly in a ventilated room and never near the face, flames or heat. They give less sweat control than antiperspirant roll-ons, so many people use both. A 150 ml can lasts about a month with daily use. Afya stocks the brands young customers ask for, at prices that suit pocket money.","Spree za mwili huchanganya kiondoa harufu na manukato mepesi, na hupendwa na vijana kwa ajili ya kuburudika haraka mchana. Shikilia kopo sentimita 15 kutoka kwenye ngozi, nyunyiza kwa muda mfupi katika chumba chenye hewa ya kutosha, na kamwe usinyunyize karibu na uso, moto au joto. Hutoa udhibiti mdogo wa jasho kuliko roll-on za kuzuia jasho, kwa hiyo watu wengi hutumia vyote viwili. Kopo la mililita 150 hudumu takriban mwezi mmoja kwa matumizi ya kila siku. Afya Basics ina chapa ambazo wateja vijana huziulizia, kwa bei zinazoendana na pesa zao za matumizi."],["Youth favourite with fast turnover","Inayopendwa na vijana na inayouzwa kwa kasi"]],"pc_deo_sens":[["Some people react to alcohol and strong fragrance in deodorants, with stinging, itching or darkening of the underarm skin. Alcohol-free, low-fragrance or pharmacy formulas reduce this risk and suit young teens starting deodorant. Do not apply on broken skin and wait a day after shaving if stinging occurs. Persistent rash or dark, velvety skin in the underarms should be checked, as it can be linked to diabetes or other conditions. Afya offers gentle options at different prices so no customer has to choose between comfort and freshness.","Baadhi ya watu huathiriwa na pombe na manukato makali ndani ya viondoa harufu, na kupata kuwashwa, muwasho au weusi wa ngozi ya kwapa. Aina zisizo na pombe, zenye manukato kidogo au za famasia hupunguza hatari hii na zinawafaa vijana wadogo wanaoanza kutumia kiondoa harufu. Usipake kwenye ngozi yenye jeraha na subiri siku moja baada ya kunyoa kama kuna kuwashwa. Vipele visivyoisha au ngozi nyeusi yenye ulaini kama mahameli kwapani vinapaswa kuchunguzwa, kwani vinaweza kuhusiana na kisukari au hali nyingine. Afya Basics inatoa chaguo laini kwa bei tofauti ili mteja yeyote asilazimike kuchagua kati ya faraja na usafi."],["Solves a common complaint and attracts pharmacy-minded buyers","Hutatua tatizo la kawaida na huvutia wanunuzi wanaopenda bidhaa za famasia"]],"pc_deo_mist":[["Body mists are lighter and cheaper than perfume, with a fresh scent that lasts a few hours, which suits hot weather and daily wear. Spray on clean skin and clothes after moisturising, as fragrance lasts longer on moisturised skin, and keep bottles out of direct sun. Travel sizes fit handbags and make easy gifts. Avoid spraying on irritated or freshly shaved skin. Afya stocks popular international mists because they are among the most gifted items in the store, especially at Eid, Christmas and Valentine’s Day.","Manukato mepesi ya mwili ni mepesi na ya bei nafuu kuliko pafyumu, yenye harufu safi inayodumu saa chache, jambo linalofaa hali ya joto na matumizi ya kila siku. Nyunyiza kwenye ngozi safi na nguo baada ya kupaka kilainishi, kwani harufu hudumu zaidi kwenye ngozi yenye unyevu, na weka chupa mbali na jua la moja kwa moja. Saizi za safari hutosha kwenye mikoba na ni zawadi rahisi. Epuka kunyunyiza kwenye ngozi iliyokereka au iliyonyolewa karibuni. Afya Basics ina manukato mepesi maarufu ya kimataifa kwa sababu ni miongoni mwa bidhaa zinazotolewa zawadi zaidi dukani, hasa wakati wa Idi, Krismasi na Siku ya Wapendanao."],["Top gifting item with strong festive and Eid peaks","Bidhaa kuu ya zawadi yenye vilele vya mauzo wakati wa sikukuu na Idi"]],"pc_deo_pfw":[["Eau de parfum contains more fragrance oil than body mist, so a few sprays last most of the day. Oriental, oud and vanilla scents are especially popular on the coast, while fresh floral scents suit daytime and office wear. Spray on pulse points such as wrists and neck, and do not rub the wrists together, which breaks down the top notes. Store away from heat and light to keep the scent stable. Afya offers a value, a mid and a premium bottle so customers can gift at any budget.","Eau de parfum ina mafuta ya manukato mengi kuliko manukato mepesi ya mwili, kwa hiyo minyunyizo michache hudumu sehemu kubwa ya siku. Harufu za kimashariki, udi na vanila zinapendwa hasa pwani, na harufu safi za maua zinafaa mchana na ofisini. Nyunyiza kwenye sehemu zenye mapigo ya moyo kama vifundo vya mikono na shingo, na usisugue vifundo pamoja, kwani hupoteza harufu za mwanzo. Hifadhi mbali na joto na mwanga ili harufu ibaki imara. Afya Basics inatoa chupa ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya hadhi ya juu ili wateja watoe zawadi kwa bajeti yoyote."],["High-value gift sales peaking at Eid and Christmas","Mauzo ya zawadi yenye thamani kubwa yanayofikia kilele wakati wa Idi na Krismasi"]],"pc_deo_pfm":[["Men’s fragrances range from light eau de toilette for daily office wear to stronger eau de parfum for evenings and celebrations. Two or three sprays on the neck and chest are enough; over-spraying is a common mistake in small offices and public transport. Woody, oud and aquatic scents are favourites, and a 100 ml bottle lasts three to six months. Keep perfume away from heat and direct sunlight. Afya stocks a value spray and recognised men’s brands as ready-made gifts.","Manukato ya wanaume yanaanzia eau de toilette nyepesi kwa matumizi ya kila siku ofisini hadi eau de parfum kali zaidi kwa jioni na sherehe. Minyunyizo miwili au mitatu shingoni na kifuani inatosha; kunyunyiza kupita kiasi ni kosa la kawaida katika ofisi ndogo na usafiri wa umma. Harufu za miti, udi na za baharini ndizo zinazopendwa, na chupa ya mililita 100 hudumu miezi mitatu hadi sita. Weka pafyumu mbali na joto na jua la moja kwa moja. Afya Basics ina spree ya bei nafuu na chapa za wanaume zinazojulikana kama zawadi zilizo tayari."],["Gift-led, high-value sales at Eid and in December","Mauzo ya thamani kubwa yanayoongozwa na zawadi wakati wa Idi na Desemba"]],"pc_men_disp":[["Disposable razors are the most common way to shave in Tanzania: cheap, light and ready to use. Twin- and triple-blade razors give a closer shave with less pressure, while single blades suit men prone to razor bumps because they cut less below the skin. Replace after three to five shaves or when the blade pulls, and never share razors, as they can transmit blood-borne infections such as hepatitis B and HIV. Rinse after every stroke and store dry. Afya stocks multipacks from value to premium so every customer gets a safe, fresh blade.","Nyembe za kutupa ndizo njia ya kawaida zaidi ya kunyoa Tanzania: ni za bei nafuu, nyepesi na tayari kutumika. Nyembe za ncha mbili na tatu hunyoa karibu zaidi kwa nguvu ndogo, ilhali nyembe za ncha moja zinawafaa wanaume wanaopata vipele vya kunyoa kwa sababu hukata kidogo chini ya ngozi. Badilisha baada ya kunyoa mara tatu hadi tano au wembe unapoanza kuvuta, na kamwe usishirikiane nyembe, kwani zinaweza kuambukiza magonjwa yanayoenezwa kwa damu kama homa ya ini B na VVU. Suuza baada ya kila mpigo na hifadhi ikiwa kavu. Afya Basics ina pakiti za nyembe nyingi kuanzia bei nafuu hadi hadhi ya juu ili kila mteja apate wembe salama na mpya."],["High-frequency, low-ticket hero for men and women","Bidhaa kuu ya bei ndogo inayonunuliwa mara nyingi na wanaume na wanawake"]],"pc_men_sys":[["A system razor has a durable handle and replaceable multi-blade cartridges with lubricating strips, giving a smoother shave and less irritation than cheap disposables. Change the cartridge every five to ten shaves; dull blades cause cuts and razor burn. Shave in the direction of hair growth if you get bumps, and use a gel or foam rather than soap. The handle is a one-off purchase, while cartridges are a profitable, regular repeat. Afya stocks the leading handles and their matching cartridges side by side.","Wembe wa mpini una mpini imara na vichwa vya ncha nyingi vinavyobadilishwa vyenye kipande cha kulainisha, hivyo hunyoa kwa ulaini zaidi na kwa muwasho mdogo kuliko nyembe za kutupa za bei nafuu. Badilisha kichwa kila baada ya kunyoa mara tano hadi kumi; nyembe butu husababisha michubuko na kuungua kwa wembe. Nyoa kufuata mwelekeo wa kuota kwa nywele kama unapata vipele, na tumia jeli au povu badala ya sabuni. Mpini hununuliwa mara moja tu, na vichwa ni manunuzi ya kurudiwa yenye faida. Afya Basics huweka mipini inayoongoza na vichwa vinavyoendana navyo pamoja."],["Handle sale locks in profitable repeat cartridge buys","Mauzo ya mpini huleta manunuzi ya vichwa yenye faida yanayorudiwa"]],"pc_men_de":[["Double-edge blades are the lowest-cost shave per use and a single sharp blade cuts cleanly at skin level, which can reduce ingrown hairs for men with tightly curled beards. Barbers must use a new blade for every client and dispose of used blades in a sealed container, because shared blades can spread hepatitis B and HIV. At home, change the blade every three to five shaves. Wrap used blades before putting them in the bin to protect waste collectors. Afya stocks bulk boxes for barbers and small packs for home users.","Viwembe vya ncha mbili ndio njia ya kunyoa yenye gharama ndogo zaidi kwa kila matumizi, na wembe mmoja mkali hukata vizuri usawa wa ngozi, jambo linaloweza kupunguza nywele kuota ndani kwa wanaume wenye ndevu za kipilipili. Vinyozi lazima watumie wembe mpya kwa kila mteja na kutupa nyembe zilizotumika kwenye chombo kilichofungwa, kwa sababu nyembe zinazoshirikiwa zinaweza kueneza homa ya ini B na VVU. Nyumbani, badilisha wembe kila baada ya kunyoa mara tatu hadi tano. Funga nyembe zilizotumika kabla ya kuzitupa kwenye pipa ili kuwalinda wakusanyaji wa taka. Afya Basics ina maboksi makubwa kwa vinyozi na pakiti ndogo kwa watumiaji wa nyumbani."],["Bulk sales to barbers plus low-cost home use","Mauzo makubwa kwa vinyozi pamoja na matumizi ya nyumbani ya gharama ndogo"]],"pc_men_gel":[["Shaving gel softens hair and creates a slippery layer that lets the blade glide, reducing cuts, razor burn and bumps compared with shaving on soap or dry skin. Wash the face with warm water first, massage a hazelnut-sized amount into a lather and leave it for a minute before shaving. Sensitive formulas with aloe and without strong fragrance suit easily irritated skin. A 200 ml can lasts about two months of daily shaving. Afya stocks a value gel and trusted brands next to razors so customers buy them together.","Jeli ya kunyolea hulainisha nywele na kutengeneza tabaka linaloteleza linaloruhusu wembe kupita kwa urahisi, hivyo hupunguza michubuko, kuungua kwa wembe na vipele ikilinganishwa na kunyoa kwa sabuni au ngozi kavu. Osha uso kwa maji ya uvuguvugu kwanza, singa kiasi cha punje ya karanga hadi itoe povu, na iache kwa dakika moja kabla ya kunyoa. Aina za ngozi nyeti zenye aloe na zisizo na manukato makali zinafaa ngozi inayokereka kwa urahisi. Kopo la mililita 200 hudumu takriban miezi miwili ya kunyoa kila siku. Afya Basics ina jeli ya bei nafuu na chapa zinazoaminika karibu na nyembe ili wateja wazinunue pamoja."],["Natural partner to every razor sale","Mwenzi wa kawaida wa kila mauzo ya wembe"]],"pc_men_foam":[["Shaving foams come out ready to use and are quick for busy mornings and barbershops, while shaving creams give a rich, cushioning lather. Like gels, they soften hair and protect skin from the blade; apply to wet skin and shave with light strokes. Sensitive versions are fragrance-light and suit men with razor burn. A 200 ml can lasts six to eight weeks. Afya stocks foams and creams at several price points to complete the shaving basket.","Povu za kunyolea hutoka tayari kutumika na ni za haraka kwa asubuhi zenye shughuli nyingi na saluni za kunyoa, ilhali krimu za kunyolea hutoa povu zito linalolinda ngozi. Kama jeli, hulainisha nywele na kulinda ngozi dhidi ya wembe; paka kwenye ngozi yenye unyevu na nyoa kwa mipigo myepesi. Aina za ngozi nyeti zina manukato kidogo na zinawafaa wanaume wanaopata kuungua kwa wembe. Kopo la mililita 200 hudumu wiki sita hadi nane. Afya Basics ina povu na krimu kwa viwango kadhaa vya bei ili kukamilisha kikapu cha kunyoa."],["Completes the shaving basket with steady repeat","Hukamilisha kikapu cha kunyoa na hununuliwa tena kwa kasi thabiti"]],"pc_men_as":[["After shaving, the skin is slightly damaged and can sting, dry out or develop bumps. Alcohol-free balms soothe and moisturise and are the better choice for sensitive skin, while alcohol-based splashes feel cooling and refreshing but can sting. Pat a small amount onto the shaved area after rinsing with cool water. A 100 ml bottle lasts two to three months. Afya stocks soothing balms and classic lotions because they are popular gifts and raise the value of grooming sales.","Baada ya kunyoa, ngozi huwa imeumia kidogo na inaweza kuwasha, kukauka au kupata vipele. Balm zisizo na pombe hutuliza na kulainisha na ndizo chaguo bora kwa ngozi nyeti, ilhali losheni zenye pombe huleta hisia ya ubaridi na kuburudisha lakini zinaweza kuwasha. Paka kiasi kidogo kwa kugusa-gusa kwenye sehemu iliyonyolewa baada ya kusuuza kwa maji baridi. Chupa ya mililita 100 hudumu miezi miwili hadi mitatu. Afya Basics ina balm za kutuliza na losheni za zamani kwa sababu ni zawadi zinazopendwa na huongeza thamani ya mauzo ya urembo wa wanaume."],["Popular men’s gift that lifts grooming baskets","Zawadi inayopendwa kwa wanaume inayoongeza vikapu vya urembo"]],"pc_men_bump":[["Razor bumps (pseudofolliculitis barbae) are very common in people with tightly curled hair, because shaved hairs curl back and grow into the skin, causing itchy bumps and dark marks. Solutions with salicylic or glycolic acid gently exfoliate and help the hairs grow out, and should be applied once or twice a day after shaving. Prevention matters most: shave less often, use a single-blade razor or clippers that leave a little stubble, shave with the grain and never pick at bumps. Infected, painful or keloid-forming bumps need a doctor. Afya stocks a proven treatment because it solves a daily problem for many customers.","Vipele vya kunyoa (pseudofolliculitis barbae) ni vya kawaida sana kwa watu wenye nywele za kipilipili, kwa sababu nywele zilizonyolewa hujipinda na kuota kurudi ndani ya ngozi, na kusababisha vipele vinavyowasha na madoa meusi. Dawa za kimiminika zenye asidi ya salisiliki au glaikoliki hubambua ngozi kwa upole na kusaidia nywele kutoka nje, na zipakwe mara moja au mbili kwa siku baada ya kunyoa. Kuzuia ndiko muhimu zaidi: nyoa mara chache zaidi, tumia wembe wa ncha moja au mashine inayoacha ndevu fupi kidogo, nyoa kufuata mwelekeo wa nywele na kamwe usitumbue vipele. Vipele vilivyoambukizwa, vyenye maumivu au vinavyotengeneza keloidi vinahitaji daktari. Afya Basics ina dawa iliyothibitishwa kwa sababu hutatua tatizo la kila siku kwa wateja wengi."],["Solves a very common problem with strong word-of-mouth","Hutatua tatizo la kawaida sana na huenezwa kwa sifa za mdomo"]],"pc_men_brd":[["Beard oils and balms soften coarse facial hair, reduce the itch of a growing beard and moisturise the skin underneath, which helps prevent flakes. Massage three to five drops into the beard and skin after washing; balms add light hold for shaping. Claims that oils make beards grow faster are not proven, as growth depends mainly on genetics and hormones. A 30 ml bottle lasts about two months. Afya stocks local and international brands because beard care is a growing, gift-friendly category for young men.","Mafuta na balm za ndevu hulainisha nywele ngumu za uso, hupunguza muwasho wa ndevu zinazoota na hulainisha ngozi iliyo chini, jambo linalosaidia kuzuia mba. Singa matone matatu hadi matano kwenye ndevu na ngozi baada ya kuosha; balm huongeza kushikilia kidogo kwa kutengeneza umbo. Madai kwamba mafuta hufanya ndevu zikue haraka hayajathibitishwa, kwani ukuaji hutegemea zaidi vinasaba na homoni. Chupa ya mililita 30 hudumu takriban miezi miwili. Afya Basics ina chapa za ndani na za kimataifa kwa sababu utunzaji wa ndevu ni kundi linalokua na linalofaa zawadi kwa vijana wa kiume."],["Growing, gift-friendly category with local brands","Kundi linalokua na linalofaa zawadi, lenye chapa za ndani"]],"pc_men_clip":[["Clippers let families cut hair at home and men keep beards tidy without a razor, which also helps those prone to razor bumps. Corded clippers are powerful and suit thick hair and frequent use; cordless and small trimmers suit beards, edges and nose or ear hair. Clean hair from the blades after each use, oil them regularly and disinfect between family members to prevent scalp infections such as ringworm. Buy registered brands with a warranty, as cheap unbranded clippers overheat and pull hair. Afya stocks a home model, a heavy-duty model and a small trimmer as high-value, long-life purchases.","Mashine za kunyoa huwezesha familia kunyoa nywele nyumbani na wanaume kupunguza ndevu bila wembe, jambo linalowasaidia pia wanaopata vipele vya kunyoa. Mashine za waya zina nguvu na zinafaa nywele nene na matumizi ya mara kwa mara; za betri na mashine ndogo zinafaa ndevu, mistari na nywele za pua au masikio. Ondoa nywele kwenye visu baada ya kila matumizi, paka mafuta mara kwa mara na safisha kwa dawa kati ya wanafamilia ili kuzuia maambukizi ya ngozi ya kichwa kama mashilingi. Nunua chapa zilizosajiliwa zenye dhamana, kwani mashine zisizo na chapa za bei nafuu hupata joto kupita kiasi na kuvuta nywele. Afya Basics ina mashine ya nyumbani, mashine imara ya kazi nzito na mashine ndogo kama manunuzi ya thamani kubwa yanayodumu."],["High-value device sale with oil and accessory follow-ups","Mauzo ya kifaa cha thamani kubwa yanayofuatwa na mafuta na vifaa vingine"]],"pc_men_clo":[["Clipper blades need a few drops of oil every few uses to cut smoothly, run cooler and last longer; dry blades pull hair and overheat. Brush hair out, switch the clipper on, add two or three drops across the blade teeth and wipe off the excess. Use only light clipper oil, not cooking or hair oil, which gums up the blades. Barbers should also disinfect blades between clients. Afya stocks clipper oil next to clippers as a cheap, essential follow-up purchase.","Visu vya mashine ya kunyoa vinahitaji matone machache ya mafuta kila baada ya matumizi kadhaa ili vikate kwa ulaini, visipate joto sana na vidumu zaidi; visu vikavu huvuta nywele na hupata joto kupita kiasi. Ondoa nywele kwa brashi, washa mashine, weka matone mawili au matatu juu ya meno ya kisu na pangusa mafuta yaliyozidi. Tumia mafuta mepesi ya mashine tu, si mafuta ya kupikia wala ya nywele, ambayo hunata kwenye visu. Vinyozi pia wanapaswa kusafisha visu kwa dawa kati ya wateja. Afya Basics huweka mafuta ya mashine karibu na mashine kama manunuzi ya ufuatiliaji ya bei ndogo na muhimu."],["Cheap essential that follows every clipper sale","Bidhaa muhimu ya bei ndogo inayofuata kila mauzo ya mashine"]],"pc_men_face":[["Men’s skin tends to be oilier and is irritated by daily shaving, so a simple routine of face wash, light moisturiser and sunscreen prevents shine, bumps and dark marks. Men’s face washes often contain charcoal or salicylic acid for oil control, and men’s moisturisers are light gels that absorb quickly. Wash morning and night and moisturise after shaving. A 100–150 ml tube lasts six to eight weeks. Afya stocks a value local brand and international brands because men’s skin care is a fast-growing category.","Ngozi ya wanaume huwa na mafuta zaidi na hukereka kwa kunyoa kila siku, kwa hiyo mpangilio rahisi wa kisafishaji cha uso, kilainishi chepesi na mafuta ya kuzuia jua huzuia kung’aa kwa mafuta, vipele na madoa meusi. Visafishaji vya uso vya wanaume mara nyingi vina mkaa au asidi ya salisiliki kudhibiti mafuta, na vilainishi vya wanaume ni jeli nyepesi zinazoingia haraka. Osha asubuhi na usiku na paka kilainishi baada ya kunyoa. Tyubu ya mililita 100–150 hudumu wiki sita hadi nane. Afya Basics ina chapa ya ndani ya bei nafuu na chapa za kimataifa kwa sababu utunzaji wa ngozi ya wanaume ni kundi linalokua kwa kasi."],["Fast-growing men’s category with repeat purchase","Kundi la wanaume linalokua haraka lenye manunuzi ya kurudiwa"]],"pc_men_body":[["Men’s shower gels and lotions differ mainly in fragrance and texture: fresh or woody scents, cooling ingredients and light, non-greasy lotions that absorb quickly in heat. Many are 3-in-1 for hair, face and body, which suits gyms and travel but can dry the face and hair with daily use. Moisturising after showering prevents ashy, dry skin on arms and legs. A 500 ml gel lasts one man about a month. Afya stocks value and premium men’s ranges as everyday buys and gifts.","Jeli za kuogea na losheni za wanaume hutofautiana hasa kwa harufu na umbile: harufu safi au za miti, viambato vya ubaridi na losheni nyepesi zisizonata zinazoingia haraka wakati wa joto. Nyingi ni 3-katika-1 kwa nywele, uso na mwili, jambo linalofaa mazoezini na safarini lakini zinaweza kukausha uso na nywele zikitumiwa kila siku. Kupaka kilainishi baada ya kuoga huzuia ngozi kavu yenye weupe mikononi na miguuni. Jeli ya mililita 500 humtosha mwanaume mmoja kwa takriban mwezi mmoja. Afya Basics ina bidhaa za wanaume za bei nafuu na za hadhi ya juu kama manunuzi ya kila siku na zawadi."],["Everyday seller with strong gifting appeal","Huuzwa kila siku na huvutia sana kama zawadi"]],"pc_men_wrz":[["Women’s razors have pivoting heads, wider handles and moisture strips designed for curved areas such as legs and underarms. Shave after a warm shower using gel or soap-free wash, in the direction of hair growth to reduce bumps, and moisturise afterwards. Replace after three to five shaves and never share razors. Darkening and bumps in the bikini area are common in curly hair; trimming or a gentle depilatory may suit better. Afya stocks value, branded and own-label packs.","Nyembe za wanawake zina vichwa vinavyopinda, mipini mipana na vipande vya kulainisha vilivyoundwa kwa sehemu zenye mikunjo kama miguu na makwapa. Nyoa baada ya kuoga maji ya uvuguvugu ukitumia jeli au kisafishaji kisicho na sabuni, kufuata mwelekeo wa nywele ili kupunguza vipele, na paka kilainishi baadaye. Badilisha baada ya kunyoa mara tatu hadi tano na kamwe usishirikiane nyembe. Weusi na vipele kwenye eneo la nguo ya ndani ni vya kawaida kwa nywele za kipilipili; kupunguza nywele au krimu laini ya kuondoa nywele vinaweza kufaa zaidi. Afya Basics ina pakiti za bei nafuu, za chapa na za chapa yake."],["Steady repeat buy across women’s personal care","Manunuzi ya kurudiwa kwa kasi thabiti katika utunzaji binafsi wa wanawake"]],"pc_men_hrc":[["Depilatory creams dissolve hair at the skin surface in a few minutes, giving smooth skin without cuts or razor bumps; results last a few days longer than shaving. Always patch-test on a small area 24 hours before first use, follow the timing on the pack exactly and never use on the face unless the product says so, on broken skin or straight after sun exposure. Choose sensitive-skin formulas for underarms and bikini line. Burning or redness means rinse at once. Afya stocks a value and a branded cream as a gentle alternative to razors.","Krimu za kuondoa nywele huyeyusha nywele kwenye uso wa ngozi ndani ya dakika chache, na kuacha ngozi laini bila michubuko wala vipele vya kunyoa; matokeo hudumu siku chache zaidi kuliko kunyoa. Kila mara jaribu kwenye sehemu ndogo saa 24 kabla ya matumizi ya kwanza, fuata muda ulioandikwa kwenye pakiti kikamilifu, na kamwe usitumie usoni isipokuwa bidhaa imeandikwa hivyo, kwenye ngozi yenye jeraha au mara baada ya kukaa juani. Chagua aina za ngozi nyeti kwa makwapa na eneo la nguo ya ndani. Kuungua au wekundu maana yake suuza mara moja. Afya Basics ina krimu ya bei nafuu na ya chapa kama mbadala laini wa wembe."],["Higher-value alternative to razors for women","Mbadala wa thamani kubwa wa nyembe kwa wanawake"]],"pc_per_reg":[["Disposable pads are the most used period product in Tanzania, and a reliable, affordable supply helps girls stay in school every day of the month. Choose absorbency by flow, change every four to six hours even on light days to prevent odour and infection, and use thicker pads or wings for active days. Most women use 15–25 pads per cycle, so 16-pad duo packs give the best value. Wrap used pads and put them in a bin, never in a toilet or pit latrine. Afya stocks value and mid-priced pads in single and duo packs so no girl has to miss school for lack of pads.","Pedi za kutupa ndizo bidhaa za hedhi zinazotumiwa zaidi Tanzania, na upatikanaji wa uhakika kwa bei nafuu husaidia wasichana kubaki shuleni kila siku ya mwezi. Chagua kiwango cha kufyonza kulingana na wingi wa damu, badilisha kila saa nne hadi sita hata siku za damu kidogo ili kuzuia harufu na maambukizi, na tumia pedi nene au zenye mabawa kwa siku zenye shughuli nyingi. Wanawake wengi hutumia pedi 15–25 kwa kila mzunguko, kwa hiyo pakiti za pedi 16 ni nafuu zaidi. Funga pedi zilizotumika na uzitupe kwenye pipa, kamwe usizitupe chooni au shimoni. Afya Basics ina pedi za bei nafuu na za kati kwa pakiti moja na mbili ili msichana yeyote asikose shule kwa kukosa pedi."],["Monthly essential for half the population, driving store visits","Hitaji la kila mwezi kwa nusu ya watu, linaloleta wateja dukani"]],"pc_per_thin":[["Ultra-thin pads use a super-absorbent core, so they hold as much as thick pads while staying invisible under clothes and more comfortable in the heat. Wings fold under the underwear to stop leaks at the sides, which suits sport, long school days and travel. Breathable cotton-feel or organic covers help women who get irritation from plastic surfaces. Change every four to six hours. Afya stocks mid and premium thin pads because many women trade up once they try them.","Pedi nyembamba sana hutumia kiini kinachofyonza kwa wingi, kwa hiyo hushikilia kiasi sawa na pedi nene huku zikibaki zisizoonekana chini ya nguo na zenye starehe zaidi wakati wa joto. Mabawa hujikunja chini ya nguo ya ndani kuzuia kuvuja pembeni, jambo linalofaa michezo, siku ndefu za shule na safari. Vifuniko vinavyopitisha hewa vyenye hisia ya pamba au vya pamba asilia huwasaidia wanawake wanaopata muwasho kutokana na sehemu za plastiki. Badilisha kila saa nne hadi sita. Afya Basics ina pedi nyembamba za kati na za hadhi ya juu kwa sababu wanawake wengi hupanda daraja mara wanapozijaribu."],["Trade-up tier that lifts margin on a monthly essential","Daraja la kupanda linaloongeza faida kwenye hitaji la kila mwezi"]],"pc_per_ngt":[["Night pads are longer and wider at the back so they protect while lying down for eight hours, and they also help on heavy days. Choose 300 mm or longer and change before sleeping and on waking. Soaking a night pad in under two hours, passing large clots or periods lasting more than seven days can mean heavy menstrual bleeding, which causes anaemia and should be checked at a clinic. Organic cotton options suit sensitive skin. Afya stocks value and premium night pads because heavy-flow customers buy them every cycle.","Pedi za usiku ni ndefu zaidi na pana zaidi nyuma ili kulinda ukiwa umelala kwa saa nane, na pia husaidia siku za damu nyingi. Chagua za milimita 300 au zaidi na badilisha kabla ya kulala na unapoamka. Kujaza pedi ya usiku ndani ya chini ya saa mbili, kutoa mabonge makubwa ya damu au hedhi kudumu zaidi ya siku saba kunaweza kumaanisha kutokwa na damu nyingi, jambo linalosababisha upungufu wa damu na linapaswa kuchunguzwa kliniki. Chaguo za pamba asilia zinafaa ngozi nyeti. Afya Basics ina pedi za usiku za bei nafuu na za hadhi ya juu kwa sababu wateja wenye damu nyingi huzinunua kila mzunguko."],["Every-cycle repeat for heavy-flow customers","Hununuliwa kila mzunguko na wateja wenye damu nyingi"]],"pc_per_lin":[["Liners are thin pads for very light flow, spotting, the last days of a period and normal daily discharge. Change them several times a day and do not wear them constantly if the skin becomes irritated; breathable or organic cotton liners reduce this. Unscented liners are better, as perfumes can irritate the vulva. Discharge that itches, smells strongly or changes colour needs a health check. Afya stocks value and premium liners because they are a frequent, high-margin top-up buy.","Pedi nyembamba za kila siku ni kwa damu kidogo sana, matone, siku za mwisho za hedhi na uchafu wa kawaida wa kila siku. Zibadilishe mara kadhaa kwa siku na usizivae muda wote kama ngozi inakereka; zinazopitisha hewa au za pamba asilia hupunguza tatizo hili. Zisizo na manukato ni bora, kwani manukato yanaweza kukereketa sehemu za siri. Uchafu unaowasha, wenye harufu kali au unaobadilika rangi unahitaji uchunguzi wa afya. Afya Basics ina pedi hizi za bei nafuu na za hadhi ya juu kwa sababu ni manunuzi ya nyongeza ya mara kwa mara yenye faida kubwa."],["Frequent top-up with good margin","Manunuzi ya nyongeza ya mara kwa mara yenye faida nzuri"]],"pc_per_tam":[["Tampons are worn inside the vagina and are popular for swimming, sport and travel. Use the lowest absorbency that suits your flow, change every four to eight hours and never leave one in for more than eight hours, because of the rare but serious risk of toxic shock syndrome. Sudden fever, rash, vomiting or dizziness while using a tampon is an emergency: remove it and seek care immediately. Applicator tampons are easier for first-time users. Afya stocks a value and a premium option for urban customers who want choice.","Tamponi huvaliwa ndani ya uke na hupendwa kwa kuogelea, michezo na safari. Tumia kiwango cha chini cha kufyonza kinachoendana na wingi wa damu yako, badilisha kila saa nne hadi nane na kamwe usiache moja ndani zaidi ya saa nane, kwa sababu ya hatari adimu lakini kubwa ya ugonjwa wa mshtuko wa sumu (toxic shock syndrome). Homa ya ghafla, vipele, kutapika au kizunguzungu ukiwa umevaa tamponi ni dharura: iondoe na tafuta huduma mara moja. Tamponi zenye kifaa cha kuingizia ni rahisi zaidi kwa wanaoanza. Afya Basics ina chaguo la bei nafuu na la hadhi ya juu kwa wateja wa mjini wanaotaka uchaguzi."],["Niche urban demand with premium pricing","Mahitaji maalum ya mjini yenye bei ya hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_per_cup":[["A menstrual cup is a soft medical-grade silicone cup worn inside the vagina that collects blood for up to 12 hours and can be reused for five years or more, saving a woman far more than its price compared with buying pads. Choose the small size for younger women and those who have not given birth vaginally, and the large size after vaginal childbirth. Wash hands before use, rinse the cup with clean water when emptying and boil it for five minutes between periods. Clean water access matters, so it suits women with a private bathroom. Afya stocks a registered cup because it is a high-value, long-term saving for customers.","Kikombe cha hedhi ni kikombe laini cha silikoni ya kiwango cha kitabibu kinachovaliwa ndani ya uke na kukusanya damu hadi saa 12, na kinaweza kutumika tena kwa miaka mitano au zaidi, hivyo kumwokolea mwanamke fedha nyingi kuliko bei yake ukilinganisha na kununua pedi. Chagua saizi ndogo kwa wanawake wadogo na wasiozaa kwa njia ya kawaida, na saizi kubwa baada ya kujifungua kwa njia ya kawaida. Nawa mikono kabla ya kutumia, suuza kikombe kwa maji safi unapokimwaga na kichemshe kwa dakika tano kati ya hedhi moja na nyingine. Upatikanaji wa maji safi ni muhimu, kwa hiyo kinawafaa wanawake wenye bafu la faragha. Afya Basics ina kikombe kilichosajiliwa kwa sababu ni akiba ya thamani kubwa ya muda mrefu kwa wateja."],["High-value, long-life product that builds loyalty","Bidhaa ya thamani kubwa inayodumu na kujenga uaminifu"]],"pc_per_reu":[["Reusable pads are made of absorbent cotton layers with a leak-proof backing and snap wings, and a set lasts about a year with good care, greatly reducing monthly costs. Rinse in cold water, wash with soap, and dry fully in direct sunlight, which helps kill germs; damp or shared pads can cause infections. Carry a small waterproof bag for used pads at school. They are a practical choice where disposable pads are costly or hard to dispose of. Afya stocks a reusable option to support girls’ school attendance and lower-income families.","Pedi za kufuliwa zimetengenezwa kwa tabaka za pamba zinazofyonza zenye sehemu ya nyuma isiyovuja na mabawa ya vifungo, na seti moja hudumu takriban mwaka mmoja ikitunzwa vizuri, hivyo hupunguza sana gharama za kila mwezi. Suuza kwa maji baridi, fua kwa sabuni, na anika zikauke kabisa kwenye jua la moja kwa moja, jambo linalosaidia kuua vijidudu; pedi zenye unyevu au zinazoshirikiwa zinaweza kusababisha maambukizi. Beba mfuko mdogo usiopitisha maji kwa pedi zilizotumika ukiwa shuleni. Ni chaguo la busara pale ambapo pedi za kutupa ni ghali au ni vigumu kuzitupa. Afya Basics ina chaguo la pedi za kufuliwa ili kusaidia wasichana kuhudhuria shule na familia zenye kipato kidogo."],["Social-impact product that builds goodwill with families and schools","Bidhaa yenye manufaa kwa jamii inayojenga nia njema kwa familia na shule"]],"pc_per_wash":[["The vagina cleans itself, and only the external vulva needs washing once a day with water or a mild, pH-balanced, fragrance-free wash. Intimate washes are gentler than ordinary soap for women who get irritation, especially during periods, in the heat or after exercise. Never douche or wash inside the vagina, as this upsets the natural balance and increases the risk of infections such as bacterial vaginosis. Itching, unusual discharge or a strong smell need a clinic or pharmacist, not a stronger wash. Afya stocks gentle value and dermatological brands with clear advice.","Uke hujisafisha wenyewe, na sehemu ya nje tu (vulva) ndiyo inayohitaji kuoshwa mara moja kwa siku kwa maji au sabuni laini yenye pH iliyosawazishwa isiyo na manukato. Sabuni maalum za sehemu za siri ni laini kuliko sabuni za kawaida kwa wanawake wanaopata muwasho, hasa wakati wa hedhi, joto au baada ya mazoezi. Kamwe usisafishe ndani ya uke kwa kumwaga maji au dawa (douching), kwani huvuruga uwiano wa asili na huongeza hatari ya maambukizi kama bacterial vaginosis. Muwasho, uchafu usio wa kawaida au harufu kali vinahitaji kliniki au mfamasia, si sabuni kali zaidi. Afya Basics ina sabuni laini za bei nafuu na za kitaalamu pamoja na ushauri wa wazi."],["Discreet, loyal repeat purchase with premium tiers","Manunuzi ya siri na ya kurudiwa yenye madaraja ya hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_per_wip":[["Intimate wipes are alcohol-free, pH-balanced wipes for freshening the external area when washing is not possible, such as while travelling or at work during a period. Use them only externally, wipe front to back and do not use them every time you go to the toilet. Individually wrapped wipes fit discreetly in a handbag. Never flush them. Afya stocks them beside pads and intimate washes as a discreet add-on.","Wipes za sehemu za siri hazina pombe na zina pH iliyosawazishwa, kwa ajili ya kujisafisha sehemu za nje pale ambapo kuosha haiwezekani, kama safarini au kazini wakati wa hedhi. Zitumie nje tu, pangusa kuanzia mbele kwenda nyuma na usizitumie kila unapoenda chooni. Wipes zilizofungwa moja moja hutosha kwa siri kwenye mkoba. Kamwe usizitupe chooni. Afya Basics huziweka karibu na pedi na sabuni za sehemu za siri kama nyongeza ya siri."],["Discreet add-on beside pads","Nyongeza ya siri karibu na pedi"]],"pc_per_pain":[["Warmth on the lower abdomen relaxes the womb muscle and eases cramps, and studies show heat works about as well as common painkillers for many women. Self-heating patches stick to underwear and stay warm for up to eight to twelve hours, so they can be worn discreetly at school or work, while a hot-water bottle filled with hot, not boiling, water and kept in its cover is the low-cost choice at home. Never apply directly to skin, do not sleep on a patch and avoid use on numb skin or with diabetes-related nerve damage. Severe pain that stops daily activity, or new pain later in life, should be checked for conditions such as endometriosis or fibroids. Afya places patches next to pads as a simple comfort add-on.","Joto kwenye sehemu ya chini ya tumbo hulegeza misuli ya mji wa mimba na kupunguza maumivu ya hedhi, na tafiti zinaonyesha joto hufanya kazi karibu sawa na dawa za kawaida za maumivu kwa wanawake wengi. Plasta zinazojipasha joto hubandikwa kwenye nguo ya ndani na hubaki na joto hadi saa nane hadi kumi na mbili, kwa hiyo zinaweza kuvaliwa kwa siri shuleni au kazini, ilhali chupa ya maji moto iliyojazwa maji ya moto yasiyochemka na kuwekwa ndani ya kifuniko chake ni chaguo la gharama ndogo nyumbani. Kamwe usibandike moja kwa moja kwenye ngozi, usilale na plasta na epuka kutumia kwenye ngozi isiyohisi au kwa wenye madhara ya neva yanayohusiana na kisukari. Maumivu makali yanayozuia shughuli za kila siku, au maumivu mapya ukiwa na umri mkubwa, yanapaswa kuchunguzwa kwa hali kama endometriosis au uvimbe wa fibroids. Afya Basics huweka plasta hizi karibu na pedi kama nyongeza rahisi ya faraja."],["Comfort add-on that increases period-basket value","Nyongeza ya faraja inayoongeza thamani ya kikapu cha hedhi"]],"pc_per_bin":[["Wrapping used pads in a disposal or bin-liner bag keeps bathrooms hygienic, controls odour and protects family members and waste collectors. Pads and wipes must never be flushed or thrown in pit latrines, as they block drains and fill latrines quickly. Draw-tape bags tie neatly, and small bins with lids suit shared bathrooms. Empty bathroom bins every day or two in hot weather. Afya stocks liners as a low-cost companion to every period purchase.","Kufunga pedi zilizotumika kwenye mfuko wa kutupia au mfuko wa pipa huweka bafu likiwa safi, hudhibiti harufu na huwalinda wanafamilia na wakusanyaji wa taka. Pedi na wipes kamwe zisitupwe chooni au kwenye vyoo vya shimo, kwani huziba mifereji na hujaza vyoo haraka. Mifuko yenye kamba hufungika vizuri, na mapipa madogo yenye vifuniko yanafaa mabafu yanayoshirikiwa. Mwaga mapipa ya bafuni kila siku moja au mbili wakati wa joto. Afya Basics ina mifuko hii kama mwenzi wa bei ndogo wa kila manunuzi ya hedhi."],["Low-cost companion that completes the period basket","Mwenzi wa bei ndogo anayekamilisha kikapu cha hedhi"]],"pc_lhf_lip":[["Lips have no oil glands, so they dry quickly in wind, sun, air-conditioning and fasting. Balms with shea butter, beeswax or petrolatum seal in moisture; apply several times a day and before bed, and avoid licking lips, which makes chapping worse. Flavoured balms appeal to children and teens but can tempt licking. Cracks at the corners of the mouth that do not heal may be an infection or vitamin deficiency and should be checked. Afya stocks value and branded balms at the till because they are cheap, compact impulse buys.","Midomo haina tezi za mafuta, kwa hiyo hukauka haraka kwa upepo, jua, viyoyozi na kufunga. Mafuta ya midomo yenye siagi ya shea, nta ya nyuki au petrolatamu hufungia unyevu; paka mara kadhaa kwa siku na kabla ya kulala, na epuka kulamba midomo, jambo linalozidisha kupasuka. Mafuta yenye ladha huwavutia watoto na vijana lakini yanaweza kushawishi kulamba. Mipasuko kwenye pembe za mdomo isiyopona inaweza kuwa maambukizi au upungufu wa vitamini na inapaswa kuchunguzwa. Afya Basics ina mafuta ya midomo ya bei nafuu na ya chapa kaunta kwa sababu ni manunuzi madogo ya ghafla ya bei ndogo."],["Classic till impulse item, peaking in the dry season and Ramadan","Bidhaa ya kawaida ya kununuliwa ghafla kaunta, inayoongezeka msimu wa ukavu na Ramadhani"]],"pc_lhf_lipp":[["Petroleum-jelly lip tins give an intensive overnight treatment for badly chapped lips, while SPF lip balms protect the lips from sunburn and darkening, which is important for people with albinism and outdoor workers in strong sun. Reapply SPF balm every two hours outdoors and after eating or drinking. Use a clean finger for tins and do not share them during cold sores. A sore on the lip that does not heal within three weeks needs a doctor. Afya stocks these as a step up from basic sticks with clear health benefits.","Makopo ya mafuta ya midomo ya petroli hutoa tiba nzito ya usiku kwa midomo iliyopasuka sana, ilhali mafuta ya midomo yenye SPF hulinda midomo dhidi ya kuungua kwa jua na kuwa myeusi, jambo muhimu kwa watu wenye ualbino na wanaofanya kazi nje kwenye jua kali. Rudia mafuta yenye SPF kila saa mbili ukiwa nje na baada ya kula au kunywa. Tumia kidole safi kwa makopo na usishirikiane wakati wa vidonda vya mdomo. Kidonda kwenye mdomo kisichopona ndani ya wiki tatu kinahitaji daktari. Afya Basics ina bidhaa hizi kama hatua ya juu kutoka kwa stiki za kawaida yenye faida za wazi za afya."],["Higher-value lip care with a clear sun-health reason","Utunzaji wa midomo wa thamani kubwa wenye sababu ya wazi ya afya dhidi ya jua"]],"pc_lhf_hand":[["Frequent handwashing, sanitiser, detergents and manual work strip the hands of oils, leading to dryness, cracks and soreness. Hand creams with glycerin, ceramides, shea or cocoa butter restore the barrier; apply after washing and at night, and wear gloves for cleaning. Health workers, cooks, mothers of babies and older adults benefit most. Cracks that bleed, weep or itch intensely may be eczema and need medical advice. Afya stocks a value, a mid and a dermatologist cream, and they make thoughtful small gifts.","Kunawa mikono mara kwa mara, vitakasa mikono, sabuni za kufulia na kazi za mikono huondoa mafuta ya mikono, na kusababisha ukavu, mipasuko na maumivu. Krimu za mikono zenye gliserini, seramaidi, shea au siagi ya kakao hurudisha kinga ya ngozi; paka baada ya kunawa na usiku, na vaa glavu unapofanya usafi. Wahudumu wa afya, wapishi, mama wa watoto wachanga na wazee hunufaika zaidi. Mipasuko inayotoa damu, inayotoa majimaji au inayowasha sana inaweza kuwa ukurutu na inahitaji ushauri wa kitabibu. Afya Basics ina krimu ya bei nafuu, ya kati na ya madaktari wa ngozi, na ni zawadi ndogo zenye maana."],["Year-round seller and an easy small gift","Huuzwa mwaka mzima na ni zawadi ndogo rahisi"]],"pc_lhf_heel":[["Cracked heels are very common where people wear sandals on dusty roads, and deep cracks can hurt, bleed and become infected. Urea-based foot creams (10% or more) soften thick skin, while heel balms with oils and butters seal in moisture; apply twice a day, especially at night under cotton socks. Gently file thick skin after soaking, once or twice a week. People with diabetes should check their feet daily, avoid cutting hard skin and see a health worker for any crack or wound. Afya stocks results-driven foot creams because customers notice the difference within days.","Visigino vilivyopasuka ni vya kawaida sana mahali ambapo watu huvaa makubadhi kwenye barabara zenye vumbi, na mipasuko mirefu inaweza kuuma, kutoa damu na kupata maambukizi. Krimu za miguu zenye yuria (asilimia 10 au zaidi) hulainisha ngozi nene, na krimu za visigino zenye mafuta na siagi hufungia unyevu; paka mara mbili kwa siku, hasa usiku ukivaa soksi za pamba. Sugua ngozi nene kwa upole baada ya kulowesha miguu, mara moja au mbili kwa wiki. Watu wenye kisukari wakague miguu yao kila siku, waepuke kukata ngozi ngumu na wamwone mhudumu wa afya kwa mpasuko au jeraha lolote. Afya Basics ina krimu za miguu zenye matokeo kwa sababu wateja huona tofauti ndani ya siku chache."],["Visible results drive loyal repeat buys","Matokeo yanayoonekana huleta manunuzi ya kurudiwa kwa uaminifu"]],"pc_lhf_file":[["A foot file or pumice gently removes thick, hard skin so foot creams can work and heels crack less. Use on skin that has been soaked in warm water for ten minutes, with light strokes, once or twice a week, then moisturise. Do not file until the skin is sore or pink, and never use blades or razors on hard skin. People with diabetes or poor circulation should not file their own feet without advice. Afya stocks durable, washable files at low prices that sell with every foot cream.","Tupa ya miguu au jiwe la kusugua huondoa kwa upole ngozi nene ngumu ili krimu za miguu zifanye kazi na visigino vipasuke kidogo. Tumia kwenye ngozi iliyolowekwa kwenye maji ya uvuguvugu kwa dakika kumi, kwa mipigo myepesi, mara moja au mbili kwa wiki, kisha paka kilainishi. Usisugue hadi ngozi iume au iwe nyekundu, na kamwe usitumie nyembe kwenye ngozi ngumu. Watu wenye kisukari au mzunguko hafifu wa damu wasisugue miguu yao wenyewe bila ushauri. Afya Basics ina tupa za kudumu zinazooshwa kwa bei ndogo zinazouzwa pamoja na kila krimu ya miguu."],["Durable add-on to every foot-cream sale","Nyongeza inayodumu kwenye kila mauzo ya krimu ya miguu"]],"pc_lhf_nclip":[["Sharp, well-made clippers cut nails cleanly, while blunt ones split and tear them. Use a larger, straight-edged clipper for toenails and cut straight across, not down the sides, to prevent painful ingrown toenails; file rough edges afterwards. Clean clippers with alcohol and avoid sharing them, as fungal infections spread this way. Stainless-steel clippers last for years. Afya stocks value and premium clippers at low prices as a household essential and an add-on to foot care.","Visu vikali vilivyotengenezwa vizuri hukata kucha kwa usafi, ilhali visu butu hupasua na kuchana kucha. Tumia kisu kikubwa chenye ncha iliyonyooka kwa kucha za miguu na kata moja kwa moja, si kushuka pembeni, ili kuzuia kucha kuota ndani kwa maumivu; sawazisha kingo zilizochongoka baadaye. Safisha visu kwa spiriti na epuka kushirikiana, kwani maambukizi ya fangasi huenea kwa njia hii. Visu vya chuma kisichoshika kutu hudumu miaka mingi. Afya Basics ina visu vya bei nafuu na vya hadhi ya juu kwa bei ndogo kama hitaji la kila kaya na nyongeza ya utunzaji wa miguu."],["Household essential with low price and long life","Hitaji la kila kaya lenye bei ndogo na linalodumu"]],"pc_lhf_mani":[["A manicure set with clippers, file and cuticle tools lets people care for nails at home rather than sharing salon tools, which can spread fungal infections. Push cuticles back gently rather than cutting them, as cuticles protect against infection. Acetone-free polish removers are gentler on nails and skin but slower; use any remover in a ventilated room, away from flames, and moisturise afterwards. Keep removers away from children. Afya stocks a compact set and a low-cost remover, both popular gifts and add-ons.","Seti ya kutunza kucha yenye kisu, tupa na vifaa vya ngozi ya kucha huwawezesha watu kutunza kucha nyumbani badala ya kushirikiana vifaa vya saluni, jambo linaloweza kueneza maambukizi ya fangasi. Sukuma ngozi ya pembeni ya kucha (cuticle) kwa upole badala ya kuikata, kwani hulinda dhidi ya maambukizi. Viondoa rangi visivyo na asetoni ni laini kwa kucha na ngozi lakini hufanya kazi polepole; tumia kiondoa chochote katika chumba chenye hewa ya kutosha, mbali na moto, na paka kilainishi baadaye. Weka viondoa rangi mbali na watoto. Afya Basics ina seti ndogo na kiondoa rangi cha bei ndogo, vyote vikiwa zawadi na nyongeza zinazopendwa."],["Gift-friendly set plus a low-cost repeat item","Seti inayofaa zawadi pamoja na bidhaa ya bei ndogo inayonunuliwa tena"]],"pc_lhf_fung":[["Athlete’s foot is a common fungal infection that thrives in hot, sweaty shoes and causes itching, peeling and cracking between the toes. Clotrimazole or miconazole creams, applied twice a day and continued for one to two weeks after the skin looks clear, usually cure it, and antifungal powders keep feet and shoes dry to prevent it returning. Dry carefully between the toes, change socks daily and do not share towels. See a health worker if the nails are thick and discoloured, the skin is broken and red, or you have diabetes. Afya stocks registered over-the-counter antifungals with clear instructions.","Fangasi wa miguu (athlete’s foot) ni maambukizi ya kawaida yanayostawi katika viatu vya joto vyenye jasho, na husababisha muwasho, ngozi kubambuka na kupasuka katikati ya vidole. Krimu za klotrimazoli au mikonazoli zikipakwa mara mbili kwa siku na kuendelea wiki moja hadi mbili baada ya ngozi kuonekana imepona kwa kawaida huponya, na poda za kuzuia fangasi huweka miguu na viatu vikavu ili kuzuia kurudi. Kausha vizuri katikati ya vidole, badilisha soksi kila siku na usishirikiane taulo. Muone mhudumu wa afya kama kucha ni nene na zimebadilika rangi, ngozi ina majeraha na wekundu, au una kisukari. Afya Basics ina dawa za fangasi zilizosajiliwa zinazouzwa bila agizo la daktari, pamoja na maelekezo ya wazi."],["Problem-solving item with seasonal peaks in heat and rains","Bidhaa ya kutatua tatizo yenye vilele vya mauzo wakati wa joto na mvua"]],"pc_lhf_corn":[["Corns are small areas of thick, hard skin caused by pressure and friction, usually from tight shoes, and they can be very painful. Hydrocolloid corn and blister plasters cushion the area, relieve pressure and keep a moist healing environment; leave them on until they start to come off by themselves. Avoid medicated corn plasters with salicylic acid if you have diabetes, poor circulation or fragile skin, and never cut corns yourself. Well-fitting shoes are the real long-term solution. Afya stocks cushioning plasters beside foot creams and files.","Sugu (corns) ni sehemu ndogo za ngozi nene ngumu zinazosababishwa na shinikizo na msuguano, kwa kawaida kutokana na viatu vinavyobana, na zinaweza kuuma sana. Plasta za haidrokoloidi za sugu na malengelenge hulinda sehemu hiyo, hupunguza shinikizo na huweka mazingira yenye unyevu ya kupona; ziache hadi zianze kutoka zenyewe. Epuka plasta za sugu zenye dawa ya asidi ya salisiliki kama una kisukari, mzunguko hafifu wa damu au ngozi dhaifu, na kamwe usikate sugu mwenyewe. Viatu vinavyokutosha vizuri ndio suluhisho la kudumu. Afya Basics huweka plasta hizi karibu na krimu na tupa za miguu."],["Specialist foot item with premium margin","Bidhaa maalum ya miguu yenye faida ya hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_lhf_tweez":[["Good tweezers have precisely aligned tips that grip a single hair or splinter without slipping; slanted tips suit eyebrows and pointed tips suit splinters and ingrown hairs. Wipe the tips with alcohol before and after use, and pluck in the direction of hair growth. Do not dig into the skin to remove ingrown hairs; a warm compress and gentle exfoliation usually free them. Stainless-steel tweezers last for years. Afya stocks reliable tweezers as a small, durable add-on and first-aid essential.","Koleo ndogo nzuri zina ncha zilizolingana kwa usahihi zinazoshika unywele mmoja au kibanzi bila kuteleza; ncha zilizoinama zinafaa nyusi na ncha zilizochongoka zinafaa vibanzi na nywele zinazoota ndani. Pangusa ncha kwa spiriti kabla na baada ya kutumia, na ng’oa kufuata mwelekeo wa kuota kwa nywele. Usichimbe ngozi kutoa nywele zilizoota ndani; kitambaa cha maji ya uvuguvugu na kubambua ngozi kwa upole kwa kawaida huzitoa. Koleo za chuma kisichoshika kutu hudumu miaka mingi. Afya Basics ina koleo za kuaminika kama nyongeza ndogo inayodumu na hitaji la huduma ya kwanza."],["Small, durable add-on with first-aid crossover","Nyongeza ndogo inayodumu, inayotumika pia kwa huduma ya kwanza"]],"pc_eye_tear":[["Artificial tears replace and stabilise the eye’s tear film and relieve dryness, grittiness and tired eyes caused by long screen use, dusty roads, wind and air-conditioning. Use one or two drops up to four times a day; preservative-free single-dose vials suit frequent use and contact-lens wearers. Do not touch the dropper tip to the eye, and discard bottles 28 days after opening. Redness drops that shrink blood vessels should only be used briefly, as eyes can rebound redder. A painful red eye, sudden blurred vision, light sensitivity or discharge needs an eye clinic, not drops. Afya stocks registered lubricants from value to premium.","Machozi bandia hurudisha na kuimarisha tabaka la machozi la jicho na hupunguza ukavu, kukwaruza na uchovu wa macho unaosababishwa na kutumia skrini muda mrefu, barabara zenye vumbi, upepo na viyoyozi. Tumia tone moja au mawili hadi mara nne kwa siku; chupa ndogo za dozi moja zisizo na kihifadhi zinafaa matumizi ya mara kwa mara na wanaovaa lenzi. Usiguse ncha ya chupa kwenye jicho, na tupa chupa siku 28 baada ya kuifungua. Matone ya kuondoa wekundu yanayobana mishipa ya damu yatumike kwa muda mfupi tu, kwani macho yanaweza kurudi mekundu zaidi. Jicho jekundu lenye maumivu, kuona ukungu ghafla, kuumizwa na mwanga au kutokwa na uchafu vinahitaji kliniki ya macho, si matone. Afya Basics ina vilainishi vilivyosajiliwa kuanzia bei nafuu hadi hadhi ya juu."],["Growing screen-age need with good margins","Hitaji linalokua katika zama za skrini lenye faida nzuri"]],"pc_eye_lens":[["Multipurpose solution cleans, rinses, disinfects and stores soft contact lenses, and correct lens hygiene prevents serious eye infections. Rub and rinse lenses with fresh solution every time, never top up old solution, and never use tap water or saliva. Replace the lens case every one to three months and let it air-dry upside down. Remove lenses and see an eye specialist for pain, redness or blurred vision. Afya stocks a value and a premium solution because lens wearers buy every month and value reliable supply.","Dawa ya matumizi mengi husafisha, husuuza, huua vijidudu na huhifadhi lenzi laini za macho, na usafi sahihi wa lenzi huzuia maambukizi makubwa ya macho. Sugua na suuza lenzi kwa dawa mpya kila wakati, kamwe usiongeze dawa mpya juu ya dawa ya zamani, na kamwe usitumie maji ya bomba wala mate. Badilisha kasha la lenzi kila mwezi mmoja hadi mitatu na liache likauke hewani likiwa limepinduliwa. Ondoa lenzi na mwone mtaalamu wa macho kwa maumivu, wekundu au kuona ukungu. Afya Basics ina dawa ya bei nafuu na ya hadhi ya juu kwa sababu wavaaji wa lenzi hununua kila mwezi na huthamini upatikanaji wa uhakika."],["Monthly repeat from a loyal, higher-income niche","Manunuzi ya kila mwezi kutoka kwa kundi dogo aminifu lenye kipato kikubwa"]],"pc_eye_wash":[["Sterile eye washes rinse dust, sand and minor irritants from the eyes and soothe them after a dusty journey, swimming or long hours outdoors. Use the eye bath or pour gently from the inner corner outwards, and discard the solution after the opening period printed on the bottle. For chemical splashes, rinse immediately with lots of clean running water for at least 15 minutes and go to hospital. A foreign body that stays stuck, a scratch or worsening redness needs an eye clinic. Afya stocks a trusted eye wash as part of the household eye basics.","Viosha macho visivyo na vijidudu husafisha vumbi, mchanga na vitu vidogo vinavyokereketa machoni na hutuliza macho baada ya safari yenye vumbi, kuogelea au saa nyingi nje. Tumia kikombe cha kuoshea macho au mimina kwa upole kuanzia pembe ya ndani kwenda nje, na tupa dawa baada ya muda wa matumizi ulioandikwa kwenye chupa. Kwa kemikali iliyorukia machoni, suuza mara moja kwa maji mengi safi yanayotiririka kwa angalau dakika 15 na nenda hospitali. Kitu kilichokwama kisichotoka, mkwaruzo au wekundu unaozidi vinahitaji kliniki ya macho. Afya Basics ina kiosha macho kinachoaminika kama sehemu ya mahitaji ya msingi ya macho nyumbani."],["Household basic with dusty-season demand","Hitaji la msingi la nyumbani lenye mahitaji msimu wa vumbi"]],"pc_eye_glass":[["Pre-moistened lens wipes clean glasses without scratching the coatings, which household tissue and clothing can damage over time. Use one wipe for both lenses, then let them air-dry or buff with a microfibre cloth. Individually wrapped wipes travel well in a bag or car. Avoid alcohol-heavy cleaners on anti-reflective coatings unless the product is made for them. Afya stocks these as a small, high-margin add-on for the many customers who wear glasses.","Wipes za lenzi zenye unyevu tayari husafisha miwani bila kukwaruza tabaka maalum, ambazo tishu za nyumbani na nguo zinaweza kuziharibu kwa muda. Tumia wipe moja kwa lenzi zote mbili, kisha ziache zikauke hewani au zing’arishe kwa kitambaa laini cha microfibre. Wipes zilizofungwa moja moja ni rahisi kubeba kwenye mkoba au gari. Epuka visafishaji vyenye pombe nyingi kwenye lenzi zenye kinga ya kuakisi mwanga isipokuwa bidhaa imetengenezwa kwa ajili yake. Afya Basics ina wipes hizi kama nyongeza ndogo yenye faida kubwa kwa wateja wengi wanaovaa miwani."],["Small, high-margin add-on for glasses wearers","Nyongeza ndogo yenye faida kubwa kwa wavaaji wa miwani"]],"pc_eye_mask":[["Darkness signals the brain to release melatonin, so an eye mask helps shift workers, travellers and light sleepers fall asleep and stay asleep, especially with early sunrise or bright streetlights. Contoured masks avoid pressure on the eyelids and let you blink, and sets with ear plugs block noise too. Wash fabric masks weekly. Persistent poor sleep, loud snoring or daytime sleepiness deserve a medical check. Afya stocks a comfortable set as a travel and gift item.","Giza huashiria ubongo kutoa melatonini, kwa hiyo kifuniko cha macho huwasaidia wanaofanya kazi kwa zamu, wasafiri na wanaoamka kwa urahisi kupata usingizi na kuendelea kulala, hasa jua linapochomoza mapema au taa za barabarani zikiwa kali. Vifuniko vyenye umbo hufanya kusiwe na shinikizo kwenye kope na kukuruhusu kupepesa macho, na seti zenye vizibo vya masikio huzuia kelele pia. Osha vifuniko vya kitambaa kila wiki. Usingizi mbaya unaoendelea, kukoroma kwa sauti kubwa au kusinzia mchana vinastahili uchunguzi wa kitabibu. Afya Basics ina seti yenye starehe kama bidhaa ya safari na zawadi."],["Travel and gift item with good margin","Bidhaa ya safari na zawadi yenye faida nzuri"]],"pc_ear_buds":[["Cotton buds are useful for cleaning the outer ear folds, touching up make-up and applying creams, but they should never be pushed into the ear canal, which cleans itself; doing so pushes wax deeper and can injure the eardrum. Paper or bamboo stems are more environmentally friendly than plastic. Safety buds with wide tips suit babies’ outer ears. Keep the pack closed and dry. Afya stocks value, own-label and branded buds as a cheap, frequent household buy.","Vijiti vya pamba vinafaa kusafisha mikunjo ya nje ya sikio, kurekebisha vipodozi na kupaka krimu, lakini kamwe visisukumwe ndani ya mrija wa sikio, ambao hujisafisha wenyewe; kufanya hivyo husukuma nta ndani zaidi na kunaweza kujeruhi ngoma ya sikio. Vijiti vya karatasi au mianzi ni rafiki zaidi kwa mazingira kuliko vya plastiki. Vijiti vya usalama vyenye ncha pana vinafaa masikio ya nje ya watoto wachanga. Weka pakiti ikiwa imefungwa na kavu. Afya Basics ina vijiti vya bei nafuu, vya chapa yake na vya chapa nyingine kama manunuzi ya nyumbani ya bei ndogo na ya mara kwa mara."],["Cheap, frequent household buy","Manunuzi ya nyumbani ya bei ndogo na ya mara kwa mara"]],"pc_ear_plug":[["Foam ear plugs reduce noise for better sleep in busy neighbourhoods and protect hearing in noisy workplaces, while silicone plugs seal out water for swimmers. Roll foam plugs into a thin cylinder, insert while gently pulling the ear up and back, and hold for a few seconds while they expand. Replace foam plugs regularly and keep them clean to avoid ear infections. Long exposure to loud noise causes permanent hearing loss, so workers with machines or music should always protect their ears. Afya stocks foam and specialist plugs at accessible prices.","Vizibo vya masikio vya sponji hupunguza kelele ili kupata usingizi bora katika mitaa yenye shughuli nyingi na hulinda usikivu katika sehemu za kazi zenye kelele, ilhali vizibo vya silikoni huzuia maji kwa waogeleaji. Viringisha vizibo vya sponji kuwa silinda nyembamba, ingiza huku ukivuta sikio juu na nyuma kwa upole, na shikilia kwa sekunde chache vinapopanuka. Badilisha vizibo vya sponji mara kwa mara na viweke safi ili kuepuka maambukizi ya sikio. Kukaa muda mrefu kwenye kelele kubwa husababisha upotevu wa kudumu wa usikivu, kwa hiyo wafanyakazi wa mashine au muziki walinde masikio yao kila wakati. Afya Basics ina vizibo vya sponji na maalum kwa bei nafuu."],["Low-cost, useful item with workplace and travel demand","Bidhaa ya bei ndogo yenye manufaa, yenye mahitaji kazini na safarini"]],"pc_ear_wax":[["Ear wax protects the ear and usually comes out on its own, but it can harden and block the canal, causing muffled hearing, fullness or ringing. Softening drops based on olive oil, sodium bicarbonate or urea hydrogen peroxide are used two or three times a day for three to five days, lying with the ear upwards for a few minutes after each dose. Do not use drops if you have ear pain, discharge, a perforated eardrum or grommets, and never dig with cotton buds or hairpins. If hearing does not improve after a week, a clinic can remove the wax safely. Afya stocks registered drops from value to branded.","Nta ya sikio hulinda sikio na kwa kawaida hutoka yenyewe, lakini inaweza kuwa ngumu na kuziba mrija wa sikio, na kusababisha kusikia kwa shida, hisia ya kujaa au mlio masikioni. Matone ya kulainisha yenye mafuta ya zeituni, sodiamu bikaboneti au yuria haidrojeni peroksaidi hutumiwa mara mbili au tatu kwa siku kwa siku tatu hadi tano, ukilala sikio likiwa juu kwa dakika chache baada ya kila dozi. Usitumie matone kama una maumivu ya sikio, uchafu unaotoka, ngoma ya sikio iliyotoboka au mirija ya sikio (grommets), na kamwe usichokonoe kwa vijiti vya pamba au pini za nywele. Usikivu usipoimarika baada ya wiki moja, kliniki inaweza kuondoa nta kwa usalama. Afya Basics ina matone yaliyosajiliwa kuanzia bei nafuu hadi ya chapa."],["Problem-solving pharmacy item that replaces risky home remedies","Bidhaa ya famasia ya kutatua tatizo inayochukua nafasi ya tiba hatari za nyumbani"]],"pc_srh_cm":[["Used correctly every time, latex condoms are highly effective at preventing HIV, other sexually transmitted infections and pregnancy, and they are the only method that does all three. Check the expiry date and quality mark, open the pack carefully without teeth or nails, pinch the tip as you roll it on and use a new condom for every act. Use only water- or silicone-based lubricant, as oils and petroleum jelly weaken latex. Store away from heat and wallets, which damage latex. Afya sells condoms discreetly at the till and online, in small and value packs, because easy, judgement-free access saves lives.","Zikitumiwa ipasavyo kila mara, kondomu za mpira (latex) zina ufanisi mkubwa katika kuzuia VVU, magonjwa mengine ya zinaa na mimba, na ndiyo njia pekee inayofanya yote matatu. Angalia tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi na alama ya ubora, fungua pakiti kwa uangalifu bila kutumia meno wala kucha, bana ncha unapoivisha na tumia kondomu mpya kwa kila tendo. Tumia vilainishi vya maji au silikoni tu, kwani mafuta na mafuta mazito ya petroli hudhoofisha mpira. Hifadhi mbali na joto na pochi, ambavyo huharibu mpira. Afya Basics huuza kondomu kwa usiri kaunta na mtandaoni, kwa pakiti ndogo na kubwa za bei nafuu, kwa sababu upatikanaji rahisi bila kuhukumiwa huokoa maisha."],["Essential health product with steady, discreet repeat sales","Bidhaa muhimu ya afya yenye mauzo thabiti ya siri yanayorudiwa"]],"pc_srh_cmv":[["Larger packs cut the cost per condom sharply, which helps people use a new condom every time rather than reusing or skipping. All registered latex condoms are tested to the same international standard, so a value brand protects as well as a premium one when used correctly. Keep a supply at home rather than relying on last-minute purchases, and check the expiry date on each foil. Store in a cool, dry place. Afya stocks value bulk packs so cost is never a reason to go without protection.","Pakiti kubwa hupunguza sana gharama kwa kila kondomu, jambo linalowasaidia watu kutumia kondomu mpya kila mara badala ya kurudia au kuacha. Kondomu zote za mpira zilizosajiliwa hupimwa kwa kiwango kimoja cha kimataifa, kwa hiyo chapa ya bei nafuu hulinda sawa na ya hadhi ya juu ikitumiwa ipasavyo. Weka akiba nyumbani badala ya kutegemea kununua dakika za mwisho, na angalia tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi kwenye kila pakiti ndogo. Hifadhi mahali penye ubaridi na ukavu. Afya Basics ina pakiti kubwa za bei nafuu ili gharama isiwe kamwe sababu ya kukosa kinga."],["Value tier that grows volume and loyalty","Daraja la bei nafuu linaloongeza wingi wa mauzo na uaminifu"]],"pc_srh_cmt":[["Thin, ribbed, dotted and flavoured condoms make protection more appealing, which encourages consistent use, the single most important factor in their effectiveness. Ultra-thin condoms pass the same strength tests as standard ones. Flavoured condoms are intended for oral sex; for vaginal sex, choose unflavoured types, as sugars can upset vaginal balance. Follow the same rules: check the date, use lubricant compatible with latex and use a new one every time. Afya offers a choice of styles because variety keeps customers using condoms.","Kondomu nyembamba, zenye mistari, vitone na ladha hufanya kinga ivutie zaidi, jambo linalohimiza matumizi ya kila mara, ambalo ndilo jambo muhimu zaidi kwa ufanisi wake. Kondomu nyembamba sana hupita vipimo vile vile vya uimara kama kondomu za kawaida. Kondomu zenye ladha zimekusudiwa kwa ngono ya mdomo; kwa ngono ya uke, chagua zisizo na ladha, kwani sukari zinaweza kuvuruga uwiano wa uke. Fuata kanuni zile zile: angalia tarehe, tumia kilainishi kinachoendana na mpira na tumia mpya kila mara. Afya Basics inatoa mitindo mbalimbali kwa sababu utofauti huwafanya wateja waendelee kutumia kondomu."],["Higher-margin variants that encourage consistent use","Aina zenye faida kubwa zaidi zinazohimiza matumizi ya kila mara"]],"pc_srh_cmx":[["A condom that is too tight is more likely to break and less likely to be used, so offering a larger fit improves both safety and comfort. Large condoms are wider at the head or shaft while meeting the same safety standards. Choose a size that rolls down fully without bunching and does not slip; a condom that is too loose can come off. All the usual rules apply: check expiry, use latex-safe lubricant, and use a new condom each time. Afya stocks large fits so every customer can find a condom that works.","Kondomu inayobana kupita kiasi ina uwezekano mkubwa wa kupasuka na uwezekano mdogo wa kutumika, kwa hiyo kutoa saizi kubwa huboresha usalama na starehe kwa pamoja. Kondomu kubwa ni pana zaidi kichwani au kwenye shina huku zikikidhi viwango vile vile vya usalama. Chagua saizi inayoshuka kikamilifu bila kujikunja na isiyoteleza; kondomu iliyolegea kupita kiasi inaweza kutoka. Kanuni zote za kawaida zinatumika: angalia tarehe ya mwisho wa matumizi, tumia kilainishi salama kwa mpira, na tumia kondomu mpya kila mara. Afya Basics ina saizi kubwa ili kila mteja apate kondomu inayomfaa."],["Fills a real fit gap that drives brand switching and loyalty","Huziba pengo halisi la saizi linalovutia wateja na kujenga uaminifu"]],"pc_srh_cml":[["Some people are allergic or sensitive to latex and get itching, redness or swelling after using standard condoms. Polyisoprene latex-free condoms protect against HIV, STIs and pregnancy in the same way, feel soft and transmit body warmth well. They can be used with water- or silicone-based lubricants. Severe allergic reactions such as swelling of the lips or difficulty breathing need emergency care. Afya stocks latex-free condoms so that an allergy never becomes a barrier to protection.","Baadhi ya watu wana mzio au hukereka na mpira na hupata muwasho, wekundu au uvimbe baada ya kutumia kondomu za kawaida. Kondomu zisizo na mpira za polyisoprene hulinda dhidi ya VVU, magonjwa ya zinaa na mimba kwa njia ile ile, ni laini na hupitisha joto la mwili vizuri. Zinaweza kutumika na vilainishi vya maji au silikoni. Mzio mkali kama kuvimba midomo au kushindwa kupumua unahitaji huduma ya dharura. Afya Basics ina kondomu zisizo na mpira ili mzio usiwe kamwe kizuizi cha kujikinga."],["Premium niche with loyal buyers","Kundi dogo la hadhi ya juu lenye wanunuzi waaminifu"]],"pc_srh_lub":[["Lubricant reduces friction, which makes sex more comfortable and lowers the risk of condoms tearing; it also helps vaginal dryness during breastfeeding, after menopause or with some medicines. Water-based lubricants are safe with all condoms and easy to wash off, while silicone-based ones last longer. Never use petroleum jelly, cooking oil or lotion with latex condoms, as they weaken latex. Choose unflavoured, glycerin-light formulas if prone to thrush, and seek advice if dryness or pain persists. Afya stocks medical jellies and personal lubricants discreetly beside condoms.","Kilainishi hupunguza msuguano, jambo linalofanya tendo la ndoa liwe na starehe zaidi na hupunguza hatari ya kondomu kupasuka; pia husaidia ukavu wa uke wakati wa kunyonyesha, baada ya kukoma hedhi au kutokana na baadhi ya dawa. Vilainishi vya maji ni salama na kondomu zote na ni rahisi kuoshwa, ilhali vile vya silikoni hudumu muda mrefu zaidi. Kamwe usitumie mafuta mazito ya petroli, mafuta ya kupikia au losheni pamoja na kondomu za mpira, kwani hudhoofisha mpira. Chagua visivyo na ladha na vyenye gliserini kidogo kama unapata fangasi mara kwa mara, na tafuta ushauri kama ukavu au maumivu yanaendelea. Afya Basics ina jeli za kitabibu na vilainishi binafsi kwa usiri karibu na kondomu."],["Discreet, high-margin companion to condom sales","Mwenzi wa siri wa mauzo ya kondomu wenye faida kubwa"]],"pc_srh_preg":[["Home pregnancy tests detect the hormone hCG in urine and are over 99% accurate from the day a period is due when used correctly. Test with first-morning urine for the strongest result, read it within the time stated and repeat after three days if negative but the period still has not come. Cassettes and strips are the cheapest; midstream tests are easiest to use, and digital tests show words instead of lines. A positive test should be followed by an early antenatal visit, ideally before 12 weeks, to start folic acid and iron and plan care. Afya stocks value, midstream and digital tests sold discreetly.","Vipimo vya mimba vya nyumbani hutambua homoni ya hCG kwenye mkojo na vina usahihi wa zaidi ya asilimia 99 kuanzia siku ambayo hedhi ilitarajiwa vikitumiwa ipasavyo. Pima kwa mkojo wa kwanza wa asubuhi kwa matokeo yenye nguvu zaidi, soma ndani ya muda ulioandikwa na rudia baada ya siku tatu kama majibu ni hasi lakini hedhi bado haijaja. Kaseti na vipande ndivyo vya bei nafuu zaidi; vipimo vya mkondo wa mkojo (midstream) ni rahisi zaidi kutumia, na vipimo vya kidijitali huonyesha maneno badala ya mistari. Kipimo chanya kifuatiwe na ziara ya mapema ya kliniki ya wajawazito, ikiwezekana kabla ya wiki 12, ili kuanza foliki asidi na madini ya chuma na kupanga huduma. Afya Basics ina vipimo vya bei nafuu, vya midstream na vya kidijitali vinavyouzwa kwa usiri."],["Discreet, steady seller with value to premium tiers","Huuzwa kwa usiri kwa kasi thabiti, yenye madaraja ya bei nafuu hadi hadhi ya juu"]],"pc_srh_ovu":[["Ovulation tests detect the surge of luteinising hormone (LH) that happens 24–36 hours before an egg is released, identifying the two most fertile days of the cycle. Start testing a few days before expected ovulation, at the same time each day, and have sex on the day of a positive result and the following day. They are less reliable for women with irregular cycles or polycystic ovary syndrome, and they are not a form of contraception. Couples who have not conceived after a year of trying, or six months if the woman is over 35, should see a doctor. Afya stocks strips and digital tests as a supportive, high-value product for families planning a baby.","Vipimo vya ovulation hutambua kupanda kwa homoni ya LH kunakotokea saa 24–36 kabla ya yai kutolewa, na hivyo kubaini siku mbili zenye rutuba zaidi katika mzunguko. Anza kupima siku chache kabla ya ovulation inayotarajiwa, wakati ule ule kila siku, na fanya tendo la ndoa siku ya kipimo chanya na siku inayofuata. Havina uhakika sana kwa wanawake wenye mzunguko usio wa kawaida au ugonjwa wa vifuko vingi vya mayai (PCOS), na si njia ya kuzuia mimba. Wenzi ambao hawajapata mimba baada ya mwaka mmoja wa kujaribu, au miezi sita kama mwanamke ana zaidi ya miaka 35, wamwone daktari. Afya Basics ina vipande na vipimo vya kidijitali kama bidhaa ya kusaidia yenye thamani kubwa kwa familia zinazopanga mtoto."],["High-value product for an emotionally loyal customer group","Bidhaa ya thamani kubwa kwa kundi la wateja waaminifu kihisia"]],"pc_srh_hiv":[["HIV self-testing, recommended by the WHO and permitted in Tanzania, lets people test privately using an oral swab or finger-prick, with a result in about 20 minutes. Follow the instructions exactly and read the result within the stated time; a test taken within three months of a possible exposure may miss a recent infection, so repeat later. A reactive result is not a diagnosis and must be confirmed at a health facility, where free treatment is available and allows a long, healthy life; a negative result is a good moment to plan prevention such as condoms or PrEP. Choose registered kits with clear Kiswahili or English instructions and a helpline. Afya sells self-tests discreetly and links customers to confirmatory testing and care.","Kujipima VVU mwenyewe, kunakopendekezwa na Shirika la Afya Duniani na kuruhusiwa Tanzania, huwawezesha watu kupima kwa faragha kwa kutumia ute wa mdomo au tone la damu kutoka kidoleni, na kupata majibu ndani ya takriban dakika 20. Fuata maelekezo kikamilifu na soma majibu ndani ya muda ulioandikwa; kipimo kinachofanywa ndani ya miezi mitatu tangu uwezekano wa kuambukizwa kinaweza kushindwa kugundua maambukizi mapya, kwa hiyo rudia baadaye. Majibu yanayoonyesha uwezekano wa maambukizi si utambuzi kamili na lazima yathibitishwe katika kituo cha afya, ambako matibabu ni bure na huwezesha maisha marefu yenye afya; majibu hasi ni wakati mzuri wa kupanga kinga kama kondomu au PrEP. Chagua vipimo vilivyosajiliwa vyenye maelekezo ya wazi kwa Kiswahili au Kiingereza na namba ya msaada. Afya Basics huuza vipimo hivi kwa usiri na huwaunganisha wateja na upimaji wa uthibitisho na huduma."],["Public-health product that builds trust and links customers to care","Bidhaa ya afya ya jamii inayojenga imani na kuwaunganisha wateja na huduma"]]};window.dispatchEvent(new Event("afyatx"));